<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">USENGA UNOGILE WA YESU KILISTO KAMBA VIWANDIKIGWE NA MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc2">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat.</para>
  <para style="mt2">USENGA UNOGILE WA YESU KILISTO KAMBA VIWANDIKIGWE NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATAYO</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisto Kamba Viwandikigwe na Matayo uwo usenga umwe kulawa m'vitabu vine va Lagano da Isambi visimulila ugima wa Yesu Kilisto. Vitabu vose vino vine vokemigwa, “Injili,” nhegulo yake “Usenga Unogile.” Vitabu vino vandikigwa na Matayo, Maluko, Luka, na Yohana mkipigiti Yesu viyeshile kudanganhika. Wasomi hawaditangile zua hasa Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisto Kamba Viwandikigwe na Matayo viwandikigwe, ila vodahika kamba Usenga uno Unogile wandikigwa mkipigiti cha milao ya 60 songela kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilisto. Vivija hanhu hawandikwe Usenga uno Unogile hakutangigwa bule, ila wanhu bwando wozuza kamba wandikigwa muisi ya Islaeli na siku hata mdiwambo da Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga Uno Unogile wandikigwa na Matayo, yakalile muwila kodi kipigiti Yesu viyakalile hanamkema kuwa mwanahina wake. Vivija kakala yatangigwe mditwaga da Lawi. Matayo kakala imwe wa watumigwa longo dimwe na wabili wa Kilisto, na kakala yawandikile Wayahudi. Tugatanga gano kwavija kandika mbuli kulawa Mdilagano da Umwaka kubanza mianza 60. Matayo kalonda kulagusa kamba Yesu iyo Kilisto, Mkombola yasaguligwe na Mulungu, yakalile yahokoligwe. Vivija Matayo kandika mbuli bwando za Undewa wa Kuulanga. Wayahudi wagiza kamba Kilisto kowa mndewa wa isi yao. Ila Matayo kateganya ng'hani mkuwatenda sambiwatamanile hivo mkuusimulila Undewa wa Kuulanga uli muloho.</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisto Kamba Viwandikigwe na Matayo uwo usenga umwe kulawa m'vitabu vine va Lagano da Isambi ulongelela mbuli bwando kulawa Mdilagano da Umwaka. Avo wogalumba hamwe Malagano gano mabili. Vivija wasomi wona kamba Matayo kageza kuwinza vija vitabu vitano va mwanduso va Musa vandikigwe Mdilagano da Umwaka. Mafundo ga Yesu hakigongo (5—7) golinga na Mulungu viyamgwelele Musa Malagizo hakigongo (Ng'humb. 19:3—23:23).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Matayo kosonga kwandika Usenga Unogile mkulonga mbuli za mvumbuka ya Yesu Kilisto na mwanduso wa sang'hano yake (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 1-4">1—4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho, Matayo kosimulila sang'hano ya Yesu na mafundo gake bwando (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 5-25">5—25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Kimambukizo, Matayo kolongelela nziga ya sang'hano ya Yesu, muifa yake, na mzuso wake (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 26-28">26—28</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Wahenga wa Yesu Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk. 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Uno uwo msululu wa wahenga wa Yesu Kilisto, mwana wa Daudi, mwana wa Ablaham.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mwana wa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kulawa mulukolo lwa.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Ablaham kamulela Isaka, Isaka kamulela Yakobo, Yakobo kamulela Yuda na ndugu zake. <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yuda kamulela Pelesi na Zela, mamaao kakala Tamali, Pelesi kamulela Heziloni, Heziloni kamulela Alamu, <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Alamu kamulela Aminadabu, Aminadabu kamulela Nashoni, Nashoni kamulela Salimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salimoni kamulela Boazi, mamaake kakala Lahabu, Boazi kamulela Obedi, mamaake kakala Lusi, Obedi kamulela Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Yese kamulela Mndewa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Daudi kamulela Selemani na mtwanzi yakalile mwehe wa Ulia, <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Selemani kamulela Lehoboamu, Lehoboamu kamulela Abiya, Abiya kamulela Asafu, <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asafu kamulela Yehoshafati, Yehoshafati kamulela Yolamu, Yolamu kamulela Uzia, <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Uzia kamulela Yotamu, Yotamu kamulela Ahazi, Ahazi kamulela Hezekia, <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Hezekia kamulela Manase, Manase kamulela Amoni, Amoni kamulela Yosia, <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Yosia kamulela Yekonia na ndugu zake, kipigiti kija viwahamizigwe kuchola Babeli.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Kulawa kipigiti cha kuhamizigwa kuchola Babeli, Yekonia kamulela Shelitieli, Shelitieli kamulela Zelubabeli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zelubabeli kamulela Abiudi, Abiudi kamulela Eliakimu, Eliakimu kamulela Azoli, <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azoli kamulela Sadoki, Sadoki kamulela Akimu, Akimu kamulela Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eliudi kamulela Eliazali, Eliazali kamulela Matani, Matani kamulela Yakobo, <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yakobo kamulela Usufu, yakalile mbigalo wa Maliamu mamaake Yesu yakemigwe Kilisto. <verse eid="MAT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Avo kukala na milelo longo dimwe na mine kulawa Ablaham mbaka Daudi, na milelo longo dimwe na mine kulawa Daudi mbaka kipigiti viwahamizigwe kuchola Babeli, na milelo longo dimwe na mine kulawa uhamizo wa kuchola Babeli mbaka mvumbuka ya Kilisto.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvumbuka ya Yesu Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk. 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Vino vivo mvumbuka ya Yesu Kilisto viikalile. Mamaake, yakemigwe Maliamu, kakala mkasano wa Usufu, ila viwakalile hawanakala hamoja, kaiyona kana inda mkubitila mhiko za Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Kwavija Usufu, mkasano wake, kakala munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye, na halondile kumgela kinyala hameso ga wanhu, avo kagelegeza kumuleka kinyele. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Ila viyakalile yogelegeza gano, msenga wa Mndewa wa kuulanga kamulawila muna inzozi na kulonga, “Usufu, Mwana wa Daudi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mwana wa Daudi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kolawa mulukolo lwa Mndewa Daudi.</char></note> sambiudumbe kumsola Maliamu yawe mtwanzi wako. Kwavija kapata inda mkubitila mhiko za Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Kolela mwana mbigalo, na gweye komkema twaga jake Yesu, kwavija kowakombola wanhu zake kulawa m'vilozo vao.”<figure style="fig" alt="Angel appears in Joseph's dream" file="CN01634c.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="Mat. 1:20-21"/><verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Gano gose galawilila giladi gavikile gaja gayalongile Mndewa kubitila muhokozi, <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Mhambe kopata inda na kolela mwana mbigalo, na twaga jake kokemigwa Imanueli.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">ISAYA 7:14</ref></char>.</note> Nhegulo yake “Mulungu ka hamoja na tweye.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Usufu viyalamuke kulawa muutulo, katenda kamba msenga wa Mndewa wa kuulanga viyamulagize, avo kamsola mkasano wake Maliamu. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Ila hamkwenhukile mbaka viyamulelile mwana mbigalo. Na heyo kamkema twaga jake Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Wanhu Wali na Ilimu ya Nhondo Kulawa Haulawilo wa Zua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Yesu kavumbuka mkiwambo cha Betelehemu muisi ya Yudea, mkipigiti cha Mndewa Helode Mkulu. Na wanhu wali na ilimu ya nhondo kulawa haulawilo wa zua weza Yelusalemu, <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>wauza, “Kahalihi ayo yavumbuke giladi yawe mndewa wa Wayahudi? Kwavija tuyona nhondo yake haulawilo wa zua, avo twiza kumtambikila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Mndewa Helode viyahulike vino, kagaya ng'hani mmoyo, heyo hamoja na wanhu wose wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Kawakema wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, kawauza, “Halihi hondayaleligwe Kilisto?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Wamwidika, “Mkiwambo cha Betelehemu muisi ya Yudea, kwavija vino vivo yandikigwe na muhokozi,<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>‘Na gweye, Betelehemu, uli muisi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">huli mdodo hagatigati ya watawala wa isi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">kwavija kulawa kumwako kolawilila mtawala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">yondayawalongoze wanhu zangu wa Islaeli.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Abaho, Helode kawakema kinyele waja iwanhu wali na ilimu ya nhondo wamulongele kipigiti kija inhondo viyoneke. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Kawatuma wachole Betelehemu, yolonga, “Gendeni mkaziuzagize goya mbuli za mwana hiyo, na muhamona mnongele, giladi na nie nichole kumtambikila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Viwamambukize kumtegeleza mndewa, wachola, na ija inhondo iwakalile wayonile haulawilo wa dizua, iwalongola mbaka viimile hanhu hayakalile imwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Viwaiwene inhondo, wadeng'helela ng'hani. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Viwengile mng'anda, wamona imwana hamoja na mamaake Maliamu, wafugama mavindi na kumtambikila. Abaho, wafungula masanduku gao na kumgwelela nhunza za zahabu, ubane, na manemane.<verse eid="MAT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Mulungu kawazuma mnzozi kamba sambiwambwelele Helode. Avo wabweleganya muisi yao mkubitila nzila iyagwe.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukimbilila Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Viwacholile, msenga wa Mndewa wa kuulanga kamulawila Usufu mnzozi kalonga, “Lamuka, msole imwana na mamaake mkimbilile Misili. Kaleni hiko mbaka vondanikulongele, kwavija Helode kokwiza kumzahila imwana giladi yamkome.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Avo Usufu kenuka, kamsola imwana na mamaake ikilo iija, kachola Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>ako kuyakalile mbaka Helode viyadanganhike. Giladi kamba gavikile gaja galongigwe na Mndewa kubitila muhokozi, “Nimkema Mwanangu kulawa Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wana Wadodo Wokomigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Helode viyawene kamba kavwiziligwa na iwanhu wali na ilimu ya nhondo, kagevuzika ng'hani. Kalagiza kamba wana wose wa kimbigalo wa kiwambo cha Betelehemu na ng'ambu zake zose, wali na milao mibili kwiza hasi wakomigwe, songela viyalongeligwe na waja iwanhu wali na ilimu ya nhondo mmbuli za ija inhondo kipigiti viilawilile.<verse eid="MAT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Abaho, gavikila gaja galongigwe na muhokozi Yelemia,<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Dizwi dihulikwa ako Lama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">kililo na giogio kulu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Laheli kowalilila wanage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">halonda kuhembekezwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">kwavija wahaduhu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubwela Kulawa Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Mndewa Helode viyadanganhike, msenga wa Mndewa wa kuulanga kamulawila Usufu mnzozi ako Misili <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>kalonga, “Lamuka, msole imwana na mamaake, uchole muisi ya Islaeli, kwavija wose walondile kumkoma imwana wadanganhika.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Avo Usufu kenuka, kamsola imwana na mamaake, na kubwela muisi ya Islaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Ila Usufu viyahulike kamba Alikelao iyo mtawala wa Yudea kasola hanhu ha tataake Mndewa Helode Mkulu, kadumba kuchola hiko. Na heyo viyazumigwe mnzozi, kanyelenhukila kuisi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Kachola, kakala mkiwambo kikemigwe Nazaleti, giladi gavikile gaja galongigwe na wahokozi, “Kokemigwa Mnazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yohana M'batiza Kowapetela Wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mlk. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk. 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Mazua higo Yohana M'batiza keza, yowapetela wanhu mkiwala cha Yudea, <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>kalonga, “Lekeni vilozo venu, kwavija Undewa wa Kuulanga ukwenhuka!” <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Kwavija Yohana iyo yalongigwe na muhokozi Isaya, viyalongile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Munhu kenula dizwi muluwala, yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Itandeni nzila ya Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">Mgoloseleni nzila zake!’ ” <figure style="fig" alt="John The Baptist Preaching" file="JohnTheBaptistPreaching_WA03809.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="3:1-3">Yohana kowapetela wanhu.</figure><verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Yohana kavala guo ditendigwe na mijusu ya ngamia na lukumbulu lwa kwembe mchuno chake, na mandia gake gakala nzige na uki. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Wanhu kulawa Yelusalemu, kulawa muisi yose ya Yudea na ng'ambu zose za Mdibonde da Yolodani, wamcholela. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Wavilonga vilozo vao haulongozi wa wanhu, na heyo kawabatiza muna Ulwanda lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Yohana viyawawene Mafalisayo na Masadukayo bwando womwizila giladi wabatizigwe, kawalongela, “Mweye wana wa nyoka! Yalihi yawazumile kulukimbila lusango lwa Mulungu londalwize? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Tendeni mbuli zilagusa kamba muleka vilozo venu. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Sambimgelegeze kamba modaha kuikimbila nhaguso ya Mulungu mkulonga, ‘Ablaham iyo muhenga wetu.’ Nowalongela, Mulungu kodaha kusola mabwe gano na kumtendela lukolo Ablaham! <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Nhemo ya hana gamasina ga imibiki, na kila m'biki uleka kulela mujo unogile wokanhigwa na kwasigwa muna umoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Nie nowabatiza mweye na mazi kulagusa kamba muleka vilozo venu, ila hachugu changu kokwiza yali na mhiko kubanza nie, nie silumbile hata kupapa ng'hwabasa zake. Heyo kowabatiza na Loho wa Mulungu na moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Heyo kana kia chake mmakono cha kubetela, giladi yaikunzanye ngano yake kukano na mikumvi yaisome na moto hauzimikaga.”<figure style="fig" alt="man winnowing grain" file="NT-06 Threshing.jpg" size="col" loc="Matthew 3:12" copy="Jonathan McDaniel" ref="Mat. 3:12"/><verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubatizigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk. 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk. 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Abaho, Yesu keza kulawa Galilaya, kachola hana Ulwanda lwa Yolodani giladi yabatizigwe na Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Ila Yohana kageza kumgomesa, kalonga, “Nie nolondigwa kubatizigwa na gweye, na gweye kokwiza kumwangu?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Ila Yesu kamwidika, “Leka iwe vino sambi, kwavija tolondigwa kutenda vino giladi kugavikiza gaja gose gayalagize Mulungu.” Avo Yohana katogola.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Bahaja Yesu viyabatizigwe, kalawa muna gamazi. Baho ulanga uvuguka, kamona Loho wa Mulungu yomuhumulukila yalingile kamba hua na kukala uchana yake. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Na dizwi kulawa kuulanga dilonga, “Ino iyo Mwanangu mnogelwa, ninogelwe nayo.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Kugezigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk. 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk. 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Abaho, Yesu kalongozwa na Loho wa Mulungu mbaka muluwala giladi yagezigwe na Mwenembago. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Viyamambukize funga ya mazua malongo mane ikilo na imisi, Yesu kona nzala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Abaho, Mwenembago kamcholela kamgeza yomulongela, “Uhawa gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu, galongele mabwe gano gagaluke mikate.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Ila Yesu kedika kalonga, “Yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, ‘Munhu hawa mgima sama ya mkate wiyeka, ila mkila mbuli ilawa mmulomo wa Mulungu.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 8:3</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Abaho, Mwenembago kamsola Yesu mbaka Yelusalemu, Wambo Ding'alile, na kumwika hachana hana inhomboti ya Ing'anda ya Mulungu, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>kamulongela, “Uhawa gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu, ibwanhe hasi, kwavija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Mulungu kokulagizila wasenga zake wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">wakudang'he mmakono gao,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">giladi mgulu wako sambiuikwale mdibwe.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">ZABULI 91:11-12</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Vivija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, ‘Sambiumgeze Mndewa Mulungu wako.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 6:16</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Abaho, Mwenembago kamsola Yesu mbaka hana ikigongo kitali, kamulagusila ndewa zose za ulumwengu na yenzi zake. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>Kamulongela, “Gano gose nokugwelela uhanifugamila mavindi na kunitambikila.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Abaho, Yesu kamulongela, “Goboka, Mwenembago! Kwavija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, ‘Mtambikile Mndewa Mulungu wako na umsang'hanikile heyo yeiyeka!’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 6:13</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Abaho, Mwenembago kamuleka, na wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga weza na kumsang'hanikila.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kosonga Kuwapetela Wanhu ako Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk. 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk. 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12-13"/>Yesu viyahulike kamba Yohana kageligwa mkifungo, kachola kukiwambo cha Nazaleti muisi ya Galilaya. Kasegela Nazaleti, kachola kukala Kapenaumu, kiwambo kikalile behi na Dilamba da Galilaya, muisi za mitala ya Wazabuloni na Wanaftali, <verse eid="MAT 4:12-13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>giladi gavikile gaja galongigwe na muhokozi Isaya,<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Isi ya Zabuloni na isi ya Naftali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">nzila ya kuchola m'bahali, mwambu uyagwe wa Ulwanda lwa Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya, isi ya Wamhazi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Wanhu wokala mdiziza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">wona mulangaza mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Na waja wose wokala muisi ya ziza da ifa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">mulangaza uwamwemwesa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 9:1-2">ISAYA 9:1-2</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Songela kipigiti kija Yesu kasonga kuwapetela wanhu yolonga, “Lekeni vilozo venu, kwavija Undewa wa Kuulanga ukwenhuka!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowakema Waloa Somba Wane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk. 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk. 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Yesu viyakalile yotembela mumgwazo wa Idilamba da Galilaya, kawona wandugu wabili, Simoni yakemigwe Petulo na mdodo wake Endelea. Wakala wotanda nhando zao mdilamba, kwavija wakala waloa somba. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Ng'holelezeni, na nie nowatenda muwe waloa wanhu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Bahaja wazileka nhando zao, wamkoleleza.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Viyacholile haulongozi kidogo, kawona wandugu wabili wayagwe, Yakobo na mdodo wake Yohana, wanage Zebedayo, wakalile muna ingalawa hamoja na tataao Zebedayo, wozigongomanya nhando zao. Yesu kawakema, <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>na baho waileka ingalawa na tataao, wamkoleleza.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kofundiza, Kowapetela Wanhu, na Kuwahonya Watamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk. 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Yesu kachola kila hanhu m'viwambo va Galilaya, yofundiza muna zing'anda zao za nhambiko na kuupeta Usenga Unogile wa Undewa wa Mulungu, na kuwahonya wanhu wakalile na kila utamu na unyondenyonde. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Mbuli zake zenela muisi yose ya Silia. Wamgalila wanhu wose wakalile wokugula kila utamu, wakalile wokona vihile, wakalile na vinyamkela, wakalile na kisango, na wakalile waholole, na heyo kawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Dale kulu da wanhu dimkoleleza, wanhu kulawa Galilaya, kulawa kuviwambo longo dimwe vikemigwa Dekapoli, kulawa Yelusalemu, Yudea, na mwambu uyagwe wa Ulwanda lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="ms">Yesu Kowapetela Wanhu Mkigongo</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-7:29">5:1—7:29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Yesu viyadiwene didale da wanhu, kakwela hakigongo, kakala hasi. Wanahina zake wamcholela, <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>na heyo kasonga kuwafundiza.<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Deng'ho da Kweli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk. 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>“Wamota waja wakumbulu wa loho,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wakumbulu wa loho </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wanhu wali na sulukila ya kuifundiza ng'hani mbuli za Mulungu.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">kwavija Undewa wa Kuulanga uli wao!<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Wamota waja wose wali na giogio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">kwavija wobwezigwa imioyo!<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Wamota waja wali na mioyo iholile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">kwavija woihala isi!<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Wamota waja wose wali na nzala na ng'hilu ya kutenda ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">kwavija wokwigutizwa!<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Wamota wali na bazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">kwavija wokonelwa bazi!<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Wamota wali na mioyo ing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">kwavija womona Mulungu!<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Wamota wagombelezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">kwavija wokemigwa wana wa Mulungu!<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Wamota awo wogazigwa sama ya kutenda ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">kwavija Undewa wa Kuulanga uli wao!<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>“Mmota mweye haja wanhu wahawaliga, na kuwagaza, na kuwavwizila mbuli zose zihile sama yangu. <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Deng'heleleni na kutoa ng'henze, kwavija nhunza yenu yowa ng'hulu kuulanga. Kwavija vino vivo wagazigwe wahokozi wawalongole.<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Munyu na Mulangaza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk. 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk. 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>“Mweye iwo munyu wa isi. Ila munyu uhagiza kilandu chake, vodahikaze kuutenda unoge kabili? Haunoga mkinhu chochose, ila wokwasigwa hanze na kubojagwa na wanhu.<verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>“Mweye iwo mulangaza wa ulumwengu mokoneka na wanhu wose, kamba viwodaha kuwona mulangaza wa wambo dizengigwe hakigongo. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Haduhu munhu yobwinha kiwenge na kukigubika na kinongo. Ila kokika uchana hakingolobweda, giladi kimmwemwesele kila munhu yali mng'anda. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Vivo na mweye, mulangaza wenu umwemwese haulongozi wa wanhu, giladi wone sang'hano zenu zinogile, na hewo wamuyenzi Tata wenu wa kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mafundo ga Malagizo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>“Sambimgelegeze kamba niza kugatengula Malagizo ga Musa na mafundo ga wahokozi, ila kugavikiza. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Nowalongela ikweli, mbaka ulanga na isi vondavisegele,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka ulanga na isi vondavisegele </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka ikimambukizo cha isi.</char></note> haduhu hata helufi imwe ndodo kulawa Mmalagizo ga Musa yondaisegezigwe mbaka mbuli zose zivikile. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Avo, munhu yoyose yoleka kutenda ndagizi imwe ili ndodo, na kuwafundiza wanhu sambiwaitende, munhu iyo kokemigwa mdodo muna Undewa wa Kuulanga. Ila munhu yoyose yondayazitende ndagizi zino na kuzifundiza, munhu iyo kokemigwa mkulu muna Undewa wa Kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Kwavija nowalongela, mbuli zenu zilibule uzenzeleganye zihaleka kuzibanza zija za Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, hamdaha kwingila Muundewa wa Kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fundo da Lusango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luk. 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>“Muhulika kamba wanhu wa umwaka viwalongeligwe, ‘Sambiukome, na yoyose yondayatende avo kotagusigwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Ila nie nowalongela, munhu yoyose yomonela lusango ndugu yake kotagusigwa, na munhu yoyose yomuliga ndugu yake kolondigwa yagaligwe Kukitala Kikulu cha Isi ya Wayahudi, na munhu yoyose yolonga, ‘Gweye kwa m'bozi’ ka mdihekaheka da kwingila hana umoto wa kuzimu. <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>Avo, kamba uhalonda kulava nhunza yako hana ikilingo cha kulavila nhosa, na kukumbukila kamba kuna mbuli na ndugu yako, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>ileke nhunza yako haulongozi wa ikilingo cha kulavila nhosa, tanhu genda mkailumbe na ndugu yako, abaho, leka ubwele uilave nhunza yako.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>“Ilumbe hima na munhu yokutagusa, kipigiti mng'hali mnzila mchola kukitala, giladi sambiyakugale ha mulamula, na mulamula yakugele mmakono ga wemilizi, na wemilizi wakugele mkifungo. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Nokulongela ikweli, hulawa himo mbaka ulihe deni jako jose.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fundo da Ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>“Muhulika kamba ilongwa, ‘Sambiutende ugoni.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Ila nie nowalongela, munhu yoyose yomulola mtwanzi mkumsulukila, kesha kutenda nayo ugoni mmoyo wake. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Avo kamba siso jako da ukulume dokutenda utende vilozo, ding'ole ujase kutali nagwe! Vinoga kumwako kwagiza kipindi kimwe cha lukuli lwako kubanza lukuli lwako lose lwasigwe kuzimu. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Na kamba mkono wako wa ukulume wokutenda utende vilozo, ukanhe uwase kutali nagwe! Vinoga kumwako kwagiza kipindi kimwe cha lukuli lwako kubanza lukuli lwako lose luchole kuzimu.<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fundo da Nyasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat. 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk. 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk. 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>“Vivija ilongigwa, ‘Munhu yoyose yomwasa mtwanzi wake, kolondigwa yamwandikile lupwilili lwa nyasa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Ila nie nowalongela kamba, munhu yoyose yomwasa mtwanzi wake, ila tu sama ya kilamso cha ugoni, komtenda mtwanzi hiyo yawe mgoni, na munhu yoyose yomsola mtwanzi hiyo kotenda ugoni.<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fundo da Kuiduila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>“Vivija muhulika kamba wanhu wa umwaka viwalongeligwe, ‘Sambiuiduile uvwizi ila ugoge kiduilo chako chuuiduile ha Mndewa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Ila nie nowalongela, sambimuiduile kabisa. Sambimuiduilile ulanga, kwavija kicho kigoda cha undewa cha Mulungu, <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>ama sambimuiduilile isi, kwavija kicho kigoda chake cha kwikila magulu gake, ama sambimuiduilile Yelusalemu, kwavija dijo wambo da Mndewa Mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Vivija sambiuiduilile pala jako, kwavija hudaha kutenda hata luvili lwako lumwe kuwa luzelu ama lutitu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Mbuli zenu ziwe ‘Ona’ kamba ihawa ‘Ona’ ama ‘Sio’ kamba ihawa ‘Sio.’ Chochose chondakibanze mbuli zino cholawa ha Mwenembago.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fundo da Kuibwelezela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk. 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>“Muhulika ilongigwa kamba, ‘Siso kwa siso, na zino kwa zino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Ila nie nowalongela, sambium'bwelezele mtenda gehile. Munhu yahakutoa kanza da ukulume, muhindusile na diyagwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Na munhu yahakugala kukitala na kukusolela shati jako, vivija mulekele na koti jako. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Kamba munhu yahakushulutiza umpapile bahasha yake kilometa imwe, mpapile kilometa mbili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Munhu yondayakupule, mgwelele, na munhu yoyose yolonda umkalizi, sambiumuhindukile kisogo.<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuwanogela Wadumuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk. 6:27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>“Muhulika kamba ilongigwa, ‘Mnogele munhu wa habehi nagwe, na umwihile mdumuka wako.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Ila nie nowalongela, wanogele wadumuka zako na muwatambikile waja wose wowagaza, <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>giladi muwe wana wa Tata wenu wa kuulanga. Heyo yowamwemwesela zua jake wanhu wehile na wanogile, na yowatoela mvula wazenzeleganye na wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Ihawa mowanogela wanhu wose waja wowonogela mweye, mopata nhunza yaki? Kwavija hata wawila kodi wotenda vivo! <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Na kamba mowalamsa ndugu zenu weiyeka, kinhu chaki kikulu kimtenda kubanza wayagwe? Hata Wamhazi wotenda vivo! <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Avo, sambimuhungule hanhu kamba Tata wenu wa kuulanga viyalekile kuhungula hanhu!<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Fundo da Kuweng'ha Wakumbulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>“Iteganyeni, sambimtende mbuli zenu zinogile haulongozi wa wanhu giladi mwoneke na hewo, kwavija muhatenda hivo ham'bokela nhunza kulawa ha Tata wenu wa kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>“Uhamwing'ha mkumbulu, sambiumulongele munhu yoyose mkutoa mhalati, kamba viwotenda videlenya muna zing'anda za nhambiko na mzinzila, giladi watogoligwe na wanhu. Nowalongela ikweli, wanhu hiwo wesha kubokela nhunza yao. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Ila uhamwing'ha mkumbulu, hata mkono wako wa ukumoso sambiuvitange kitendigwa na mkono wako wa ukulume,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mkono wako wa ukumoso sambiuvitange kitendigwa na mkono wako wa ukulume </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kija chuutenda sambikitangigwe na hata na ndugu yako ama mbwigaako yali habehi nagwe.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>avo nhunza yako yowa mkifiso. Abaho, Tataako, yolola kija kitendeke mkifiso, kokugwelela nhunza.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fundo da Kutambika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk. 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>“Muhatambika, sambimuwe kamba videlenya! Kwavija hewo wonogelwa kutambika kuno wemile wima muna zing'anda za nhambiko na mzinzilamhanda, giladi woneke na wanhu. Nowalongela ikweli, wesha kubokela nhunza yao. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Ila uhatambika, ingila mdigati jako, hinda ulwivi, na tambika ha Tataako yali mkifiso. Abaho, Tataako, yolola kija kitendeke mkifiso, kokugwelela nhunza.<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>“Muhatambika, sambimulonge mbuli bwando zilibule nhegulo ha Mulungu, kamba viwotenda Wamhazi, kwavija wogelegeza kamba wohulikwa sama ya mbuli zao kuwa bwando. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Sambimuilinge nao, kwavija Tata wenu kovitanga chumulonda hata mng'hali hamunampula. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Avo tambikeni kamba vino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Tata wetu wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">twaga jako diyenzigwe,<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Undewa wako wize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">chuulonda kitendeke muisi kamba viili kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Utugwelele mandia getu ga kila zua.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Vigele kumgongo vilozo vetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">kamba tweye vituwagela kumgongo wanhu watutendile mbuli zihile.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Sambiutugele mkugezigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">ila utukombole kulawa ha Mwenembago.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">Kwavija Undewa, na mhiko, na yenzi vako gweye gunge na gunge. Amina.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zabule </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kwavija Undewa, na mhiko, na yenzi vako gweye gunge na gunge. Amina. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>“Kwavija kamba muhawagela kumgongo wanhu wawatendile mbuli zihile, vivija na Tata wenu wa kuulanga kovigela kumgongo vilozo venu. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Ila kamba hamuwagela kumgongo wanhu wawatendile mbuli zihile, vivija na Tata wenu wa kuulanga havigela kumgongo vilozo venu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fundo da Kufunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>“Muhafunga, sambimnyunguale kamba viwotenda videlenya, kwavija wosinalika giladi watogolwe na wanhu kamba wafunga. Nowalongela ikweli, wesha kubokela nhunza yao. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Uhafunga, suluza kihanga chako abaho bakaza mavuta pala jako, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>giladi wanhu sambiwavitange kamba kufunga. Ila Tataako yoleka koneka, kovitanga. Na Tataako, yolola kija kitendeke mkifiso, kokugwelela nhunza.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwika Ngama Kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk. 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>“Sambimwiikile ngama muisi, aho hana ivimhungu na ng'hangaga hondawabanange, na wabavi wobena wokwingila na kwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Ila ikeni ngama kuulanga, kulibule vimhungu na ng'hangaga wondawabanange, na wabavi hawabena na kwingila na kwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Kwavija hanhu haili ngama yako, vivija na moyo wako baho hondaukale.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiwenge cha Lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk. 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>“Siso dijo kiwenge cha lukuli. Ihawa siso jako gima, lukuli lwako lose lomema mulangaza. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Ila siso jako dihabanangika, lukuli lwako lose lomema ziza.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ziza </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kuleka kuvimanya.</char></note> Na kamba mulangaza uli mgati yako wowa ziza, avo ziza hijo dowa kulu!<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulungu na Mali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk. 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>“Haduhu munhu yodaha kuwasang'hanikila wandewa wabili, kwavija komwihila imwe na kumnogela iyagwe, ama komnanahila imwe na kum'beza iyagwe. Hudaha kumsang'hanikila Mulungu kuno usang'hanikila mali.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>“Avo nowalongela, sambimuigazile ugima wenu, kamba mje choni ama mung'we choni, ama ng'huli zenu, kamba m'vale choni. Ugima hauzamile kubanza mandia? Na lukuli haluzamile kubanza vivalo? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Waloleni ndege wa kuulanga, hawahanda, hawahuna, na hawakunzanya mmakano, na Tata wenu wa kuulanga kowagwelela mandia. Avo, mweye mzama ng'hani kubanza ndege. <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Yalihi mmwanza wenu mkuigaza yodaha kuiyongezela saa dimwe da ugima wake?<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>“Habali muigazila vivalo? Loleni malua ga kumgunda vigokula, hagasang'hana ama kuitendela vivalo. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Nowalongela kamba hata Selemani na yenzi yake yose havazigwe vinogile kamba dimwe da malua gano. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Ihawa kamba Mulungu kodivaza jani da kumgunda, dija lelo dabaho na mayo dokwasigwa muna umoto, vino heyo haleka kuwavaza vinogile mweye wanhu muli na nhamanila ndodo?<verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>“Avo sambimuigaze mkulonga, ‘Toja choni?’ ama ‘Tong'wa choni?’ ama ‘Tovala choni?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Kwavija Wamhazi wovizahila vinhu vino vose, na Tata wenu wa kuulanga kovitanga kamba movilonda vinhu vino vose. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Ila uzahileni tanhu Undewa wa Mulungu na ndagizi zake, na vinhu vino vose mogweleligwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Avo sambimuigazile mayo, kwavija mayo yowa na migayo yake yenyego. Mgayo wa zua dimwe wotosha kwa zua dimwe.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuwatagusa Wayagwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk. 6:37-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>“Sambimuwataguse wayagwe, na Mulungu hawatagusa mweye, <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>kwavija kamba vimuwatagusa wayagwe, vivo na Mulungu vondayawataguse mweye, na mhima iija yondamuwapimile wayagwe, iyo mhima yondampimilwe mweye. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Habali ukilola kikupi msiso da ndugu yako, na huchona kibanzi kili msiso jako mwenyego? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Kodaha vilihi kumulongela ndugu yako, ‘Beta nikulave kikupi mdisiso jako,’ kuno gweye kuna kibanzi mdisiso jako? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Gweye kidelenya! Songa tanhu kulava kibanzi msiso jako mwenyego, giladi udahe kulola goya, abaho, leka ulave kikupi msiso da ndugu yako.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>“Sambimuwagwelele umbwa vinhu ving'alile, kamba muhatenda avo, wowahindukila na kuwadega, na sambimuwasile mitumbi lulu zenu, kamba muhatenda avo, wozibojaga.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pula, Zahila, Toa Hodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk. 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>“Puleni, mogweleligwa. Zahileni, movumbula. Toeni hodi, movugulilwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Kwavija yoyose yopula kogweleligwa, na yoyose yozahila kovumbula, na yoyose yotoa hodi kovugulilwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Ama yalihi mmwanza wenu, kamba mwanage yahampula mkate, komgwelela dibwe? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Ama yahampula somba, komgwelela nyoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Ihawa mweye mtenda mbuli zihile, movitanga kuwagwelela wanenu vinhu vinogile, avo, Tata wenu wa kuulanga kabanza ng'hani kuwagwelela vinhu vinogile waja wose wompula!<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>“Avo, chochose chumulonda mtendeligwe na wanhu, na mweye muwatendele vivo, kwavija gano gago mafundo ga Malagizo ga Musa na wahokozi.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwivi Lusisili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk. 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>“Ingileni mkubitila lwivi lusisili, kwavija lwivi lugazi na zila gazi dilongoza kuubananzi, na wondawengile kubitila zila hijo wowa bwando. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Ila lwivi lusisili na inzila yakibabani ilongoza kuugima, na wanhu wondawayone wowa wadodo.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">M'biki na Mujo Wake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk. 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>“Iteganyeni na wahokozi wa uvwizi, womwizileni kunze walingile kamba ng'hondolo, ila mgati mbwizi wodumbiza. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Mowatambula kubitila sang'hano zao. Vino wanhu wobawa zabibu muna imizomola, ama tini muna imingemba? <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Avo, m'biki unogile wolela mujo unogile, ila m'biki wihile wolela mujo wihile. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>M'biki unogile haudaha kulela mujo wihile, na m'biki wihile haudaha kulela mujo unogile. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Na m'biki wowose uleka kulela mujo unogile wokanhigwa na kwasigwa muna umoto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Avo, mowatambula kubitila sang'hano zao.<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Siwatangile Mweye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk. 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>“Sio kila munhu yonikema, ‘Mndewa, Mndewa’ yondayengile muna Uundewa wa Kuulanga, ila heyo yogatenda gaja goyolonda Tataangu wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Mdizua da nhaguso wanhu bwando wonilongela, ‘Mndewa, Mndewa! Hatuhokole mditwaga jako, na mditwaga jako tuwinga vinyamkela, na kutenda mizonza bwando?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Abaho, nowalongela, ‘Siwatangile mweye. Segeleni hamwangu, mweye watenda gehile!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wazenga Ng'anda Wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk. 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>“Avo munhu yoyose yohulika mbuli zangu na kuzisang'hana kolinga na munhu yali na nzewele yozenga ng'anda yake uchana ya dibwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Mvula itoa, nyanda zitula, na beho dibuma na kuitoa ng'anda hiyo, ila haitulike, kwavija msingi wake uzengigwa mdidibwe.<verse eid="MAT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>“Ila munhu yoyose yohulika mbuli zangu na kuleka kuzisang'hana kolinga na munhu m'bozi yozenga ng'anda yake mmisenga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Mvula itoa, nyanda zitula, na beho dibuma na kuitoa ng'anda hiyo, nayo itulika, na nhulika yake ikala ihile ng'hani!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Udaho wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Yesu viyamambukize kulonga gano, didale da wanhu dikanganya mafundo gake, <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>kwavija hafundize kamba wafundiza zao wa Malagizo ga Musa, ila kafundiza kamba munhu yali na udaho.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Munhu Yali na Dikulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk. 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk. 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Yesu viyahumuluke kulawa mkigongo, madale makulu ga wanhu gamkoleleza. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Na munhu yakalile na dikulu kamwizila na kamfugamila mavindi, kalonga, “Mndewa, uhalonda, kodaha kunihonya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Yesu kagolosa mkono wake, kamkwasa, kamulongela, “Nolonda, uhonyigwe!” Bahaja kahonyigwa utamu wake. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Abaho, Yesu kamulongela, “Tegeleza, sambiumulongele munhu, ila genda ukailaguse ha mkulu wa nhambiko, abaho ukalave nhosa kamba viyalagize Musa, giladi wanhu wose watogole kamba kuhona.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Mtumigwa wa Mkulu wa Asikali Mia wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk. 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Yesu viyengile Kapenaumu, mkulu wa asikali mia wa Loma kamwizila, kamuyalalila <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>na kulonga, “Mndewa, mtumigwa wangu katambalala ukae, kaholola, mtamu ng'hani.” <figure style="fig" alt="centurion" file="NT-08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" loc="Matthew 8:5-8" copy="Jonathan McDaniel" ref="Mat. 8:5">Mkulu wa Asikali Mia wa Loma</figure><verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Nokwiza kumuhonya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Ija imkulu wa asikali mia wa Loma kamwidika, “Mndewa, nie silumbile gweye wingile mng'anda yangu, ila longa mbuli tu, na mtumigwa wangu kohona. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Kwavija nie mwenyego na munhu nikigwe hasi ya udaho, nna asikali hasi yangu. Nomulongela imwe, ‘Genda!’ na heyo kochola, na nomulongela iyagwe, ‘Izo!’ na heyo kokwiza. Na nomulongela mtumigwa wangu, ‘Tenda vino!’ na heyo kotenda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Yesu viyahulike vino, kakanganya na kuwalongela waja wakalile womkoleleza, “Nowalongela ikweli, sinamona munhu yoyose muisi ya Islaeli yali na nhamanila ng'hulu kamba ino. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Nowalongela kamba wanhu bwando wokwiza kulawa haulawilo wa zua na hauswelo wa zua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wanhu bwando wokwiza kulawa haulawilo wa zua na hauswelo wa zua </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wamhazi bwando wokwiza kulawa kila hanhu muulumwengu wose.</char></note> na wokala hana ulusona hamoja na Ablaham, Isaka, na Yakobo Muundewa wa Kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Ila Wana wa Undewa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wana wa Undewa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wayahudi.</char></note> wokwasigwa hanze mdiziza, ako kondawalile na kugegedula meno.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Abaho, Yesu kalonga na ija imkulu wa asikali mia wa Loma, “Genda, yotendeka kamba vija vuutamanile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Na kipigiti kikija mtumigwa wake kahona.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowahonya Wanhu Bwando</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk. 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk. 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Yesu viyavikile hakae ha Petulo, kam'vika mama mkwe yake Petulo kawasa mulusazi mtamu wa homa. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Kamkwasa mkono wake, na homa imulawa, abaho kenuka na kusonga kumsang'hanikila.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Viivikile ichungulo, wamgalila wanhu bwando wakalile na vinyamkela, na heyo kawawinga ivinyamkela mkuwakomhokela, na kawahonya wanhu wose wakalile watamu. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Giladi gavikile gaja galongigwe na muhokozi Isaya, “Heyo mwenyego kausola unyondenyonde wetu na kavipapa vitamu vetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanhu Wolonda Kumkoleleza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk. 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Yesu viyadiwene didale da wanhu domzunguluka, kawalagiza wanahina zake wachole mwambu uyagwe wa dilamba. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Mfundiza Malagizo ga Musa kamcholela, kamulongela, “Mkulufunzi, nokuwinza kokose kuuchola.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Mbwizi wana mhango, na ndege wa kuulanga wana mvulu, ila nie, Mwana wa Munhu, kabule hanhu ha kutambalika pala jake.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Mwanahina iyagwe kamulongela, “Mndewa, nileke tanhu nyhole hazike tataangu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Ng'hweleleza nie, waleke wadanganhike wazike wadanganhike wayao.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu hano kakala yowalonga wanhu wadanganhike muloho.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kodikomhokela Beho Mdilamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk. 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk. 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Abaho, Yesu kakwela muingalawa hamoja na wanahina zake. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Bahaja dilawila kukuzumbi kulu mdilamba, avo mawimbi gaimemeza mazi ingalawa. Ila Yesu kakala yawasile. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Wanahina zake wamcholela wamulamusa, walonga, “Mndewa, tukombole! Todanganhika!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mweye wanhu muli na nhamanila ndodo, habali mkona bwembwe?” Abaho, kenuka na kudikomhokela dibeho na gamawimbi, na kukala hapozike.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Wanahina zake wakanganya, walonga, “Ino iyo munhu wa vilihi? Hata beho na mawimbi vomuhulika!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowahonya Wanhu Wabili Wali na Vinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk. 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk. 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Yesu viyavikile mwambu uyagwe wa idilamba hana iisi ya Gadala, kaiting'hana na wanhu wabili wali na vinyamkela wakalile wolawa mmapanga. Wakala wodumbiza ng'hani mbaka hakukalile na munhu yadahile kubita nzila iyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Waguta nyangi, walonga, “Kotulonda choni, Mwana wa Mulungu? Kwiza kutugaza kipigiti king'hali hakinavika?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kipigiti king'hali hakinavika </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kipigiti cha ikimambukizo cha ulumwengu Mulungu kuwatagusa wanhu wali muisi.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Behi na aho kukala na dale kulu da mitumbi wodila. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Vinyamkela wamuyalalila Yesu, walonga, “Uhatuwinga, tuleke tuchole tukengile mdidale dija da mitumbi.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Gendeni!” Avo walawa, wachola kuwengila mitumbi. Baho dale jose da imitumbi dihumulukila kubonde mdigema, dingila mdilamba na kudanganhika mmazi.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Waja iwanhu wakalile wowachunga imitumbi wakimbila, wachola hana ikiwambo na kuwalongela wanhu mbuli zose, hamoja na gaja gawalawilile waja wanhu wakalile na vinyamkela. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Avo, wanhu wose wa ikiwambo kija walawa, wamcholela Yesu, na viwamuwene, wamuyalalila yahalawe muisi yao.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Munhu Yaholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk. 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk. 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Yesu kakwela muingalawa, kaloka na kuvika mkiwambo chake. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamgalila munhu yaholole, yatambalale mulusazi. Yesu viyaiwene nhamanila yao, kamulongela ija imunhu yaholole, “Gangamala, mwanangu! Vilozo vako vigeligwa kumgongo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Abaho, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wakalile baho wailongela wenyego kwa wenyego, “Munhu ino kofukula!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Yesu kavitanga vija viwakalile wogelegeza, kalonga, “Habali mgelegeza vihile mmioyo yenu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Dilihi dibuhile ng'hani, kulonga, ‘Vilozo vako vigeligwa kumgongo,’ ama kulonga, ‘Ima wima utembele?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Nolonda m'vitange kamba, nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nna udaho wa kuvigela kumgongo vilozo va wanhu muisi.” Abaho, kamulongela ija imunhu yaholole, “Ima wima, papa lusazi lwako, uchole ukae yako!”<verse eid="MAT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Ija imunhu kema wima, na kuchola ukae. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Wanhu viwonile gano, wakanganya na kudumba, na kumuyenzi Mulungu yawagwelele wanhu udaho kamba uja.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komkema Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mlk. 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk. 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yesu viyakalile yochola kulawa haja, kamona munhu yokemigwa Matayo yakalile muna ing'anda yake ya kulihila kodi, na heyo kamulongela, “Ng'holeleza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Matayo kenuka, kamkoleleza.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wakala woja mandia ga ichungulo hakae ya Matayo. Wawila kodi bwando na wene vilozo wayagwe weza na kuja hamoja na hewo. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Mafalisayo viwonile gano, wawauza wanahina zake, “Habali mkulufunzi wenu yoja na wawila kodi na wene vilozo wayagwe?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Yesu viyahulike vino, kalonga, “Wanhu wagima hawamulonda mganga, ila waja wali watamu wawo womulonda. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Gendeni mkaifundize nhegulo ya ulonzi uno, ‘Nolonda bazi na sio nhosa.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Nolonda bazi na sio nhosa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sambimunigwelele nie nhosa, ila nolonda muwonele bazi wanhu wayagwe.</char></note> Kwavija sizile kuwakema wanhu walibule vilozo, ila wanhu wali na vilozo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Kufunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk. 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk. 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Abaho, wanahina wa Yohana M'batiza wamcholela Yesu, wamuuza, “Habali tweye na Mafalisayo tofunga, ila wanahina zako hawafunga?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Yesu kawedika, “Wahenza wa mulawilamhambe wodaha vilihi kulila kipigiti viwali hamoja na heyo? Ila kipigiti chokwiza, mulawilamhambe vondayasegezigwe kulawa kumwao, leka na hewo wafunge.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>“Haduhu munhu yogela kidanga cha kivalo cha sambi muna ikivalo cha umwaka, kwavija ikidanga choikunza na kuchongeza ikizonzo cha ikivalo cha umwaka. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Na wanhu hawagela divai ya sambi muna ivibuyu vitendigwe na kwembe va umwaka. Kamba wahatenda avo, ivibuyu vitendigwe na kwembe votulika, na idivai yokwitika, na ivibuyu vitendigwe na kwembe vobanangika. Ila divai ya sambi yogeligwa muna ivibuyu vitendigwe na kwembe va sambi, na vose vowa vigima.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mndele wa Mkulu na Mtwanzi Yakwasile Valo da Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk. 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk. 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Yesu viyakalile yolonga vino, mkulu imwe wa ng'anda ya nhambiko kamcholela, kamfugamila mavindi, kamulongela, “Mndele wangu sambisambi kadanganhika, ila izo umwikile mkono wako na heyo kowa mgima.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Avo Yesu hamoja na wanahina zake, wenuka, wamkoleleza.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Baho mtwanzi yakalile na utamu wa kutumika mkipigiti cha milao longo dimwe na mibili kamwizila Yesu kukisogo, abaho, kalukwasa lugigo lwa kivalo chake. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Kwavija kakala yoilongela mwenyego, “Ihawa nihagoga tu valo jake, nohona.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Yesu kahinduka kamona, kamulongela, “Mndele, gangamala! Nhamanila yako ikuhonya.” Kipigiti kikija mtwanzi ija kahona.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Yesu viyavikile hakae ya ija imkulu wa ng'anda ya nhambiko, na viyawawene wotoa mhalati,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kutoa mhalati ikala nzoela ya Wayahudi kipigiti munhu yahadanganhika.</char></note> na wanhu bwando wolila ng'hani, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>kalonga, “Segeleni! Mndele ino hadanganhike, ila kawasa!” Abaho, wanhu wose wamseka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Didale da wanhu vidilavigwe kunze, Yesu kengila mng'anda, kamgoga mkono ija imndele, na heyo kenuka. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus healing Jairus daughter" file="JesusHealingJairus'Daughter_WA03826.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="9:25">Yesu komzusa mndele wa mkulu wa ng'anda ya nhambiko.</figure> <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Mbuli zino zenela hanhu hose muisi ija.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowahonya Vimbugumbugu Wabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Yesu viyakalile yochola kulawa haja, vimbugumbugu wabili wamkweleleza, woguta nyangi, “Tonele bazi, Mwana wa Daudi!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mwana wa Daudi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kolawa mulukolo lwa Mndewa Daudi.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Yesu viyengile mng'anda, waja vimbugumbugu wamcholela, na Yesu kawauza, “Motogola kamba nie nodaha kuwahonya mweye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Wedika, “Ona, Mndewa!”<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Abaho, kagakwasa meso gao, kalonga, “Mtendeligwe kamba vija vumtamanila!” <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Na meso gao gagubuligwa. Yesu kawazuma ng'hani, kawalongela, “Sambimmulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ino!”<verse eid="MAT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Ila hewo wachola na kubwililisa mbuli za Yesu kila hanhu muisi ija.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Munhu Bubui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Wanhu viwakalile wosegela, wamgalila munhu yakalile bubui yali na kinyamkela. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Kinyamkela viyawingigwe, ija imunhu kasonga kulonga, na wanhu wose wakanganya, walonga, “Hatunachona kinhu kamba kino muisi ya Islaeli!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Ila Mafalisayo walonga, “Kowinga vinyamkela na mhiko za mkulu wa vinyamkela.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowonela Bazi Wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yesu kachola mmiwambo na m'viwambo vose, yofundiza mzing'anda zao za nhambiko, youpeta Usenga Unogile wa Undewa wa Mulungu, na kuhonya kila utamu na unyondenyonde. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Viyadiwene didale da wanhu, kawonela bazi, kwavija wakala wogaya na wabule munhu wa kuwataza, kamba ng'hondolo walibule mchunga. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Abaho, kawalongela wanahina zake, “Va kuhuna vimema ila wahunaji wadodo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Avo mpuleni mwene mgunda, yawagale wahunaji wahune vakuja vake.<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Watumigwa wa Kilisto Longo Dimwe na Wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk. 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk. 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yesu kawakema wanahina zake longo dimwe na wabili na kuwagwelela udaho wa kuwinga vinyamkela na kuhonya kila utamu na unyondenyonde. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Gano gago matwaga ga watumigwa wa Kilisto longo dimwe na wabili, wa mwanduso Simoni, yakalile yokemigwa Petulo, na ndugu yake Endelea, Yakobo na ndugu yake Yohana wanage Zebedayo, <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filipo na Batolomayo, Tomaso na Matayo muwila kodi, Yakobo mwanage Alufayo, Tadayo, <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simoni, yakalile yokemigwa Mgombeleza Isi ya Islaeli, na Yuda Isikalioti, yamuhonzile Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowalagiza Wanahina Longo Dimwe na Wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mlk. 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk. 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Yesu kawalagiza wano longo dimwe na wabili, kawalongela, “Sambimchole muisi ya Wamhazi ama kwingila mkiwambo cha Wasamalia, <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>ila gendeni ha ng'hondolo wapotele, awo wali wanhu wa Islaeli. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Ako kumchola, peteni mulonga, ‘Undewa wa Kuulanga ukwenhuka!’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Honyeni watamu, zuseni wadanganhike, wahonyeni watamu wa dikulu, wingeni vinyamkela. Mgweleligwa bule, laveni bule. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Sambimsole hela yoyose mmikwiji yenu, <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>sambimsole mkoba wa mwanza, ama koti da ikabili, ama ng'hwabasa, ama fimbo. Kwavija msang'hana kolondigwa yagweleligwe kitumetume chake.<verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>“Vondamwingile mdiwambo ama mkiwambo, zahileni munhu yowatogola, giladi mkale hamwake mbaka vondamsegele. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Vondamwingile muna ing'anda ija walamseni wanhu wa ng'anda ija. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Na kamba wanhu wa ng'anda hiyo wahawabokela, walekeleni tindiwalo jenu, ila kamba hawawabokela, tindiwalo jenu diwabwelele mweye. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Ihawa munhu yoyose hawabokela mweye ama kuzitegeleza mbuli zenu, muhalawa muna ing'anda hiyo ama mkiwambo hicho, kung'unheni timbwisi dinanahile mmagulu genu, kamba usindila ulagusa kamba hewo wenyego waulema Usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Nowalongela ikweli, yodahika wanhu wa viwambo va Sodoma na Gomola koneligwa bazi mdizua da nhaguso kubanza wanhu wa kiwambo hicho!<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Migayo Ikwiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mlk. 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk. 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>“Tegelezeni! Nie nowatuma kamba ng'hondolo mdidale da mbwizi, muwe na nzewele kamba nyoka na muwe na moyo uholile kamba hua. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Iteganyeni na wanhu, kwavija wowagala mweye kukitala, na wowalanha mbalati muna zing'anda zao za nhambiko. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Mogaligwa ha wakulu wa isi na wandewa sama yangu nie, giladi munilavile usindila kumwao na ha Wamhazi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Vondamgaligwe mkitala, sambimgelegeze kamba mulonge choni ama mulonge vilihi, kwavija kipigiti kicho mogweleligwa mbuli ya kulonga. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Kwavija sio mweye wondamulonge, ila Loho wa Tata wenu iyo yondayalonge kubitila mweye.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>“Ndugu komuhonza ndugu yake giladi yakomigwe, na tata komuhonza mwanage, na wana wowahonza watata zao na wamama zao, na kuwatenda wakomigwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Mokwihilwa na wanhu wose sama ya twaga jangu. Ila yondayazaganye mbaka hakimambukizo, iyo yondayakomboligwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Wahawagaza mkiwambo kimwe, kimbilileni mkiwambo kiyagwe. Nowalongela ikweli, nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nokwiza kipigiti hamnamambukiza kubita m'viwambo vose va Islaeli.<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>“Mwanahina ham'banza mkulufunzi wake, na nyakadala ham'banza mndewa wake. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Yotosha mwanahina kuwa kamba mkulufunzi wake, na nyakadala kuwa kamba mndewa wake. Ihawa mkulu wa ng'anda kokemigwa Belizebuli,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Belizebuli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iyo mkulu wa vinyamkela.</char></note> haibanza ng'hani wanhu wa ng'anda yake kukemigwa matwaga gehile ng'hani!<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yolondigwa Kudumbigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk. 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>“Avo sambimuwadumbe wanhu wano, kwavija haduhu kinhu kigubikigwe chondakileke kugubuligwa, ama kifisigwe chondakileke kutangigwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Kiniwalongela mdiziza, kipeteni hamulangaza, na kimuhulika kinyong'onywa, kipeteni mwa wanhu wose. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Sambimuwadumbe waja wose wokoma lukuli, ila hawadaha kukoma loho, mdumbeni Mulungu yodaha kubananga vose lukuli na loho na kuvasa kuzimu. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Vitongwa vibili haviuzigwa na hela ndodo? Ila hata kitongwa kimwe hakilagala hasi kamba Tata wenu halondile. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Na hata mvili zose zili mmapala genu zipetwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Avo sambimdumbe, mweye mnogeligwa ng'hani na Mulungu kubanza vitongwa bwando!<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kumtogola na Kumulema Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luk. 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>“Munhu yoyose yonitogola haulongozi wa wanhu, vivija na nie nomtogola haulongozi wa Tataangu yali kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Ila munhu yoyose yonilema haulongozi wa wanhu, vivija na nie nomulema haulongozi wa Tataangu yali kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mzahimzahi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk. 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>“Sambimgelegeze kamba niza kugala tindiwalo muisi. Bule, sizile kugala tindiwalo, ila zele. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Kwavija niza kugala uhasama ha munhu na tataake, mndele na mamaake, mkemwana na mama mkwe yake, <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>na wadumuka wa munhu iwo waja wali mng'anda yake.<verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>“Munhu yoyose yomnogela tataake ama mamaake kubanza nie, hadaha kuwa mwanahina wangu, vivija yomnogela mmhale wake ama mndele wake kubanza nie, hadaha kuwa mwanahina wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Na munhu yoleka kusola msalaba wake na kunikoleleza, hadaha kuwa mwanahina wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Munhu yogeza kuukombola ugima wake kowagiza, ila munhu yowagiza ugima wake sama yangu koukombola.<verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhunza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mlk. 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>“Munhu yowabokela mweye konibokela nie, na munhu yonibokela nie kom'bokela ija yanhumile nie. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Munhu yoyose yom'bokela muhokozi kwavija viyali muhokozi, kobokela nhunza kamba iija iyobokela muhokozi. Na munhu yoyose yom'bokela munhu yanogile kwavija viyali munhu yanogile, kobokela nhunza kamba iija iyobokela munhu yanogile. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Nowalongela ikweli, munhu yoyose yolava hata kikasi cha mazi ga uzizimi ha munhu imwe wa wano wadodo kwavija viyali mwanahina wangu, haleka bule kubokela nhunza yake.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Wasenga Kulawa ha Yohana M'batiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk. 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Yesu viyamambukize kuwagwelela malagizo wanahina zake longo dimwe na wabili, kahalawa haja, kachola kufundiza na kuwapetela wanhu mmiwambo ya isi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Yohana M'batiza viyakalile mkifungo, kazihulika sang'hano za Kilisto, avo kawalagiza wanahina zake wachole kumwake, <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>wakamuuze, “Gweye iyo ija yokwiza, ama tumulolele iyagwe?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Yesu kawedika, “Gendeni mkamulongele Yohana mbuli zimuhulika na kuzona, <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>vimbugumbugu wolola, mbetembete wotembela, wene dikulu wohonywa, vinziwi wohulika, wadanganhike wozuka, na wakumbulu wopeteligwa Usenga Unogile. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Kamota munhu ija nie nilekile kuwa king'hwaso kumwake!”<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Wanahina wa Yohana viwacholile, Yesu kasonga kudilongela didale da wanhu mbuli ya Yohana, yolonga, “Mchola kulola choni mkiwala? Ludete vulutigiswa na beho? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Mchola kulola choni? Mchola kumulola munhu yavalile vivalo vinogile? Wanhu wovala vivalo vinogile wokala mming'anda ya kindewa! <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Mchola kulola choni? Muhokozi? Ona, nowalongela, yummuwene kana ukulu kubanza muhokozi. <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>Yohana iyo munhu Nyandiko Zing'alile zimulonga, ‘Nomulagiza msenga wangu yakulongole, yondayaitande nzila yako.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Nowalongela ikweli, mmwanza wa wanhu wose waleligwe na watwanzi, haduhu yali mkulu kubanza Yohana M'batiza. Ila munhu yali mdodo kubanza wose muna Undewa wa Kuulanga iyo mkulu kubanza heyo. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Songela kipigiti cha Yohana M'batiza mbaka sambi, Undewa wa Kuulanga wokwingilwa na mhiko, na wanhu wali na mhiko wogeza kuusamha. <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Kwavija wahokozi wose wahokola na Malagizo ga Musa gahokola mbaka kipigiti cha Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>Na kamba motogola, Yohana iyo yalongigwe na wahokozi kamba iyo Eliya yondayeze. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Yali na magwiti na yahulike.<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>“Vino niwalinganyize na choni wanhu wa mazua gano? Walinga na wana wakalile hadibugano da soko na kuwakema wayagwe, <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>‘Tuwatoela ngoma ya lusona lwa zengele, ila mweye ham'vinile! Twimba vawembaga hauzisi, ila mweye hamulilile!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Kwavija Yohana viyezile halulukile kuja na kung'wa na hewo walonga, ‘Kana kinyamkela!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Mwana wa Munhu keza yoja na kung'wa, na hewo wolonga, ‘Munhu ino mmelo na mng'waji, mbwiga wa wawila kodi na wene vilozo wayagwe!’ Ila munhu kokoneka kana nzewele sama ya sang'hano zake.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miwambo Ilibule Nhamanila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk. 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Abaho, Yesu kasonga kuwakomhokela wanhu wa miwambo ija mgati yake iyatendile mizonza yake bwando kwavija wanhu zao hawalondile kuleka vilozo vao. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>“Kojona Kolazini! Kojona Betisaida! Ihawa mizonza itendeke kumwenu kamba ihatendeke Tilo na Sidoni, wanhu zao wahalekile vilozo vao umwaka mkuvala magunia na kukiibakaza mitozi! <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Ila nowalongela, yodahika Tilo na Sidoni koneligwa bazi mdizua da nhaguso kubanza mweye! <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Na gweye Kapenaumu! Kokiinula mwenyego mbaka kuulanga? Kohumuluswa mbaka kuzimu! Ihawa mizonza itendeke kumwako kamba ihatendeke Sodoma, kiwambo hicho kihakalile baho mbaka lelo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka lelo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti Matayo viyandike kitabu kino.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Ila nowalongela, yodahika Sodoma koneligwa bazi mdizua da nhaguso kubanza mweye!”<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Izoni Kumwangu Muhumule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk. 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Kipigiti kija Yesu kalonga, “Nokugwaa hewela, Tata, Mndewa wa kuulanga na isi, kwavija kuwafisa mbuli zino wanhu wali na nzewele na wasomile, ila kuwagubulila wana wadodo. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Ona, Tata, kwavija vino vivo vuulondile vitendeke.<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>“Vinhu vose nigweleligwa na Tataangu. Haduhu munhu yomtanga Mwana ila Tata, na haduhu munhu yomtanga Tata ila Mwana na munhu yoyose Mwana yolonda kumgubulila.<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>“Izoni kumwangu mweye mose mdonhile na mpapa mibahasha mikulu, na nie nowagwelela mhumulo. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Ifungeni nila yangu, na mwiifunze kumwangu, kwavija nie nihola mmoyo na nikiihumulusa, na mweye mopata mhumulo mmioyo yenu.<figure style="fig" alt="yoke" file="NT-13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" loc="Matthew 11:29-30" copy="Jonathan McDaniel" ref="Mat. 11:29">Nila Msingo za Ng'ombe Wabili</figure> <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Kwavija nila yangu hailumiza na bahasha yangu ibuha.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Zua da Mhumulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk. 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk. 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Kipigiti kija Yesu kakala yobita mmigunda ya ngano Mdizua da Mhumulo. Wanahina zake wona nzala, avo wasonga kufyola zisota za gamakungwi ga ngano na kudafuna. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Mafalisayo viwawawene, wamulongela Yesu, “Lola, wanahina zako wotenda gagomeswe kutendigwa Mdizua da Mhumulo!”<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Yesu kawedika, “Hamsomile kija chayatendile Daudi kipigiti heyo na wayage viwakalile na nzala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Kengila mdihema da Mulungu, na heyo na wayage waija imikate ilavigwe nhosa, mbuli igomeswe na Malagizo ga Musa heyo ama wayage kuija, ila wakulu wa nhambiko weiyeka. <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Ama, hamsomile muna Gamalagizo ga Musa kamba wakulu wa nhambiko wotenda mbuli zigomesigwe kutendigwa Mdizua da Mhumulo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbuli zigomesigwe kutendigwa Mdizua da Mhumulo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">zizo zino, kusoma ngodi za kulavila nhunza, kupapa vinhu, na kufusha ubane.</char></note> muna Ing'anda ya Mulungu, na hawoneka na Mulungu kamba wotenda mbuli ihile? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Nowalongela, hano hana mkulu kubanza Ng'anda ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Ila kamba muhaitangile nhegulo ya ulonzi uno, ulonga, ‘Nolonda bazi na sio nhosa,’ sambimuwataguse wanhu walibule vilozo. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Kwavija, nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nene Mndewa hata Mdizua da Mhumulo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Munhu Yaholole Mkono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk. 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk. 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Yesu kahalawa hanhu haja, kengila muna ing'anda yao ya nhambiko, <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>na muja kukala na munhu yaholole mkono. Kuno wozahila kilamso cha kumtagusa, wamuuza, “Malagizo ga Musa gotogoza kumuhonya munhu Mdizua da Mhumulo?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Munhu yalihi mmwanza wenu yali na ng'hondolo imwe yengile mdikolongo Mdizua da Mhumulo, yondayaleke kumgoga na kumulava hanze? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Munhu kazama mianza mingahi kubanza ng'hondolo! Avo, Malagizo ga Musa gotogoza kutenda ganogile Mdizua da Mhumulo.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Abaho, kamulongela ija imunhu yaholole umkono, “Golosa mkono wako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Avo kaugolosa, na uwa mgima, kamba uja uyagwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Ila, Mafalisayo walawa kunze na kwika zundo wone vija vondawamkome Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mtumigwa Yasaguligwe na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Yesu viyavitangile kamba wamwikila zundo da kumkoma, kahalawa hanhu haja, na wanhu bwando wamkweleleza. Na heyo kawahonya wanhu wose wakalile watamu, <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>na kuwalagiza sambiwamulonge heyo iyo yalihi. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Mbuli zino zivikiza kija kilongigwe na muhokozi Isaya,<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Ino iyo mtumigwa wangu inimsagule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">inimnogele, moyo wangu unogelwa nayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Nomgwelela Loho wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">na heyo koipeta nhaguso yangu ha Wamhazi.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Hagomba na munhu ama kuguta nyangi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">haduhu munhu yondayadihulike dizwi jake mzinzila za m'viwambo.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Halubena ludete luveduke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">ama kuuzima utambi ulava yosi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Mbaka vondayagatende gaja galibule uzenzeleganye gahume,<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>na Wamhazi woditamanila twaga jake.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">ISAYA 42:1-4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mlk. 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk. 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Abaho, wamgalila munhu yali na kinyamkela yakalile kimbugumbugu na bubui, na Yesu kamuwinga ikinyamkela, avo ija imunhu kadaha kulonga na kulola. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya na kulonga, “Vodahika ino kuwa Kilisto, Mwana wa Daudi?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mwana wa Daudi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kolawa mulukolo lwa Mndewa Daudi.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Mafalisayo viwahulike vino, walonga, “Munhu ino kowinga vinyamkela na udaho wa Belizebuli tu, mkulu wa vinyamkela.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Yesu kazitanga ngelegeza zao, kawalongela, “Undewa wowose uhaigola mmadalemadale, gogomba genyego kwa genyego, undewa hiwo haugendelela. Na wambo jojose ama mulango uhaigola mmadalemadale, gogomba genyego kwa genyego, mulango hiwo hawima. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Ihawa Mwenembago kowinga vinyamkela, kokiigola mwenyego, avo, undewa wake wodahaze kwima? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Na kamba nowinga vinyamkela na udaho wa Belizebuli, wanhu zenu wowinga vinyamkela na udaho waki? Avo, hewo wao wondawawataguse! <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Ila kamba nowinga vinyamkela na Loho wa Mulungu, avo, Undewa wa Mulungu uwezila.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>“Ama kodahaze munhu kwingila muna ing'anda ya munhu yali na mhiko na kum'bokonya vinhu vake, kamba hamfungile tanhu, leka yadahe kum'bokonya vinhu vili mng'anda yake?<verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>“Munhu yoyose yalekile kuwa hamoja na nie, konibeza, na munhu yoyose yalekile kukunzanya na nie, kopwililisa. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Nowalongela, vilozo vose na ufukuzi wose wogeligwa kumgongo, ila ufukuzi wa kumfukulila Loho wa Mulungu haugeligwa kumgongo. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Munhu yoyose yonilonga vihile nie, Mwana wa Munhu, vodahika kugeligwa kumgongo, ila munhu yoyose yomulonga vihile Loho wa Mulungu havidahika kugeligwa kumgongo, muulumwengu uno ama kuulumwengu ukwiza.<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">M'biki na Mujo Wake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk. 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>“M'biki uhanoga na mujo wake wonoga, na m'biki uheha vivija na mujo wake wokwiha. Kwavija m'biki wotangigwa sama ya mujo wake. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Mweye wana wa nyoka! Modahaze kulonga kinhu kinogile na ihawa mweye wenyego mwiha? Kwavija munhu kolonga gaja gaumemeze moyo wake. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Munhu yanogile kolava ganogile kulawa muna ingama ya moyo wake unogile, na munhu yehile kolava gehile kulawa muna ingama ya moyo wake wihile.<verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>“Nowalongela kamba, mdizua da nhaguso wanhu wolava mheta ya kila mbuli ihile iwailongile. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Kwavija kubitila mbuli zako kopeteligwa ganogile, na kubitila mbuli zako kotagusigwa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulonda Kilaguso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mlk. 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk. 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Abaho, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wamulongela, “Mkulufunzi, tolonda tone mizonza kulawa kumwako.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Yesu kedika kalonga, “Wanhu wa mulelo wihile na uleka kumtamanila Mulungu wolonda kilaguso! Ila hawagweleligwa kilaguso, ila kilaguso cha muhokozi Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Kamba vija Yona viyakalile muna iinda ya isomba mkulu ng'hani mazua madatu, vivija nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nokala muna umoyo wa iisi mazua madatu. <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Mdizua da nhaguso wanhu wa Ninawi wokwima na wanhu wa mulelo uno na kuwatagusa mweye, kwavija hewo waleka vilozo vao viwamuhulike Yona viyakalile yopeta. Na hano hana mkulu kubanza Yona! <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Mdizua da nhaguso Malikia wa Kusi kokwima na wanhu wa mulelo uno na kuwatagusa mweye, kwavija heyo keza kulawa kuzisota za iisi giladi yategeleze ng'hungwe ya Selemani. Na hano hana mkulu kubanza Selemani!<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinyamkela Voyobweleganya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk. 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>“Kinyamkela yahamulawa munhu, kochola kubitila hanhu hanyalile yozahila hanhu ha kuhumula, ila hahapata. <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Abaho, kolonga, ‘Nobweleganya kung'anda yangu kunilawile.’ Yahabwela na kuivika ing'anda yabule kinhu, ifagiligwa, na kuhambigwa, <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>kochola kuwasola vinyamkela wayagwe saba wehile kubanza heyo mwenyego, wokwingila na kukala himo. Na hali ya munhu hiyo yokwiha ng'hani kubanza ija ya haichanduso. Vino vivo vondaiwe ha wanhu wa mulelo uno wihile.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mamaake Yesu na Ndugu Zake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk. 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk. 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yolonga na dale da wanhu, mamaake na ndugu zake wema hanze, walonda kulonga nayo. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Munhu imwe kamulongela, “Mamaako na ndugu zako wema hanze, wolonda kulonga nagwe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Yesu kamwidika ija imunhu yamulongele, “Mamaangu iyo yalihi? Na ndugu zangu wawo walihi?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Kuno yowalinga kidole wanahina zake kalonga, “Wano wao mamaangu na ndugu zangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yogatenda goyolonda Tataangu wa kuulanga iyo ndugu yangu, lumbu jangu na mamaangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mulimi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk. 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk. 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Zua didija Yesu kalawa muna ing'anda, kakala hamgwazo wa idilamba. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Dale kulu da wanhu dimzunguluka, avo kakwela na kukala muna ingalawa. Na didale da wanhu dima mumgwazo wa idilamba. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Kawalongela vinhu bwando mmahala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Mulimi kachola kuhanda mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Viyakalile yozihanda, ziyagwe zilagalila mnzila, na ndege weza wazija. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mmabwe kukalile na ulongo mdodo. Avo zota himahima kwavija ulongo ukala mdodo. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Ila zua vidilawile diilukuza imiche na kwavija mizizi yake haingile hasi ng'hani imiche inyala. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mmizomola, imizomola ikula na kuizingiliza imiche. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Ila mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila muulongo unogile, ziyagwe zilela mia, ziyagwe zilela malongo sita, na ziyagwe zilela malongo madatu. <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Yali na magwiti na yahulike.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilamso cha Gamahala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk. 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk. 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Abaho, wanahina wamcholela Yesu wamuuza, “Habali ulonga na wanhu mmahala?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye mgweleligwa nzewele za kuzitanga nyong'onyo za Undewa wa Kuulanga, ila hewo hawagweleligwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Munhu yali na kinhu kokongezelwa na kowa navo bwando, ila munhu yalibule kinhu hata kija ikidodo chayalinacho kobokigwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Kilamso cha kulonga nao mmahala kicho kino, kamba wolola ila hawona kinhu, na wotegeleza ila hawahulika ama hawavitanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Uhokozi wa Isaya uvikila kumwao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Kuhulika mohulika, ila ham'vitanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">kulola molola, ila ham'vimanya,<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>kwavija wanhu wano wana mioyo midala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">magwiti gao wagatenda sambigahulike,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">na meso gao wafing'hiliza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Ila kamba meso gao gahalolile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">na magwiti gao gahahulike,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">wahavitangile mmioyo yao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">na kunihindukila nie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">nihawahonyile.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">ISAYA 6:9-10</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>“Ila gamota meso genu, kwavija golola, na magwiti genu, gohulika. <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Nowalongela ikweli, wahokozi na wanhu bwando walibule uzenzeleganye wasulukila kugona gano gomgona mweye, ila hawagonile, na wasulukila kugahulika gano gomuhulika mweye, ila hawagahulike.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhegulo ya Dihala da Mulimi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk. 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk. 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>“Tegelezeni nhegulo ya dihala da mulimi. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Munhu yoyose yohulika Usenga wa Undewa wa Kuulanga ila hautanga, Mwenembago kokwiza na kuusamha uja Usenga uhandigwe mmoyo wake, zino zizo mbeyu zilagalile mnzila. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Mbeyu zilagalile mmabwe zizo Usenga uyahulike munhu, na baho koubokela mkudeng'ha. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Ila kwavija ukala na mizizi midodo, avo wokala mkipigiti kiguhi. Na kiheza kipigiti cha mgayo ama kugazigwa sama ya Usenga wa Mulungu, baho kobwela kukisogo. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Mbeyu zilagalile mmizomola, zizo zimbuli ziyahulike munhu, ila bwembwe da ulumwengu uno na unogelo wa mali wozizingiliza na kuzitenda sambizilele. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Ila mbeyu ilagalile muulongo unogile iyo munhu yaihulike imbuli na kuitanga, abaho, kalela mijo bwando, imwe kalela mia, iyagwe malongo sita, na iyagwe malongo madatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Lolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Yesu kawalongela hala diyagwe, “Undewa wa Kuulanga ulinga na munhu yahandile mbeyu inogile mumgunda wake. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Ila wanhu wose viwakalile wawasile, mdumuka wake keza kahanda lolo muingano, abaho, kachola. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Ija ingano viyotile na kusonga kufumula, idilolo disonga koneka. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Nyakadala wa ija mwene mgunda keza kamulongela, ‘Mndewa, huhandile mbeyu zinogile mumgunda wako? Dilolo dilawa kwahi?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>Kamwidika, kamulongela, ‘Mdumuka iyo yatendile vino.’ Abaho, ija inyakadala kamuuza, ‘Kolonda tweye tuchole tukading'ole dilolo?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>Kamulongela, ‘Bule, kwavija kipigiti vondamding'ole dilolo, moding'ola hamoja na ingano. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Leka ingano na idilolo vose vikule hamoja mbaka kipigiti cha kuhuna. Na kipigiti hicho nowalongela wahunaji, tanhu dilundizeni idilolo, mdifunge makinzamakinza mkadisome moto, abaho, ilundizeni ingano mkaike kukano jangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mbeyu ya Haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk. 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk. 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Yesu kawalongela hala diyagwe, “Undewa wa Kuulanga ulinga na mbeyu ya haladali yaaisolile munhu na kuihanda mumgunda wake. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Mbeyu ndodo kubanza zose, ila ihakula yowa mche mkulu kubanza miche yose mkihati na hata kuwa biki kulu. Avo ndege wa kuulanga wokwiza na kuzenga mvulu mmatambi gake.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk. 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Yesu kawalongela hala diyagwe, “Undewa wa Kuulanga ulinga na mela dodo diyasolile mtwanzi na kuditibuliza muna ivibaba vidatu va usage mbaka tonge jose dilulumuka.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kofundiza Mmahala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mlk. 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Yesu kawalongela wanhu bwando mbuli zino zose mmahala, hawalongele kinhu chochose bila mahala. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Giladi gaja galongigwe na muhokozi gavikile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Nounanula mulomo wangu nilonge mmahala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Nilonge gaja gafisike songela ulumwengu vuulumbigwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhegulo ya Dihala da Idilolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Abaho, Yesu kadileka didale da wanhu, kengila mng'anda. Wanahina zake wamkwenhukila wamulongela, “Tulongele nhegulo ya dihala da idilolo da kumgunda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Imunhu yahandile imbeyu inogile iyo nie, Mwana wa Munhu, <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>umgunda uwo ulumwengu, na imbeyu inogile iyo wana wa Undewa wa Kuulanga, na idilolo dijo wanhu wa Mwenembago, <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>na imdumuka yahandile idilolo iyo Mwenembago. Gakuhuna gago zua da kimambukizo, na iwahunaji wao wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Kamba vija idilolo vidilundizwe na kusomigwa moto, vivo vondaiwe muna dizua da kimambukizo. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nowalagiza wasenga zangu wa kuulanga wavikunzanye na kuvilava hanze ya Undewa wake vija vose viwatenda wanhu watende vilozo, na waja wose watenda vilozo <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>na kuwasa mditanuli da moto. Ako kowa na kililo na kugegedula meno. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Abaho, wanhu wamnogele Mulungu wonang'hazika kamba zua Muundewa wa Tataao. Munhu yali na magwiti na yahulike!<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Ngama Ifisigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>“Undewa wa Kuulanga ulinga na ngama ifisigwe mumgunda. Na munhu imwe viyaiwene, kaifisa kabili, mkudeng'ha kachola kuguza vinhu vake vose viyalinavo, na kuugula mgunda uja.<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>“Vivija, Undewa wa Kuulanga ulinga na mchuluzi yozahila lulu zinogile, <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>na viyaiwene lulu imwe ya hela bwando, kachola na kuguza vinhu vake vose viyalinavo, na kuigula.<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Nhando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>“Vivija, Undewa wa Kuulanga ulinga na nhando itandigwe m'bahali na kunamata somba wa namna zose. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Inhando viimemile, waikwekwesa waigala mhwani, abaho, wakala hasi na kuwabagula iwasomba, wanogile waweka muna imigelo na wehila wawasa. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Vivo vondaiwe mdizua da kimambukizo, wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga wokwiza na kuwabagula wanhu wehile kulawa mwa wanhu watendile ganogile, <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>na kuwasa wanhu wehile mditanuli da moto. Ako kowa na kililo na kugegedula meno.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vinhu va Sambi na va Umwaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Yesu kawauza, “Movitanga vinhu vino vose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Wamwidika, “Ona.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Avo mfundiza yoyose wa Malagizo ga Musa yafundizigwe mbuli za Undewa wa Kuulanga kalinga na mwene ng'anda yolava vinhu va sambi na va umwaka kulawa muna ingama yake.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kolemigwa ako Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk. 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk. 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Yesu viyamambukize kulonga mahala gano, kahalawa hanhu haja, <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>kabwela hana ikiwambo chake kikemigwa Nazaleti. Kasonga kuwafundiza wanhu muna zing'anda zao za nhambiko, avo, wakanganya na kulonga, “Kaipata kwahi ng'hungwe ino na mhiko za kutenda mizonza? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Ino sio mwana wa salamala? Na mamaake hakemigwa Maliamu? Na ndugu zake sio kina Yakobo, Usufu, Simoni, na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Na lumbu zake wose hawali hano hamoja na tweye? Avo munhu ino kazipata kwahi mhiko na nzewele zino zose?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Avo hawanogelwe nayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Ila Yesu kawalongela, “Muhokozi kohishimilwa kila hanhu, ila mkiwambo chake mwenyego na mng'anda yake mwenyego.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Avo hatendile mizonza bwando hanhu haja kwavija wakala wabule nhamanila.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yohana M'batiza Kodanganhika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mlk. 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk. 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Kipigiti kija Helode Antipa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Helode Antipa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kakala mwana wa Mndewa Helode Mkulu.</char></note> mtawala wa Galilaya, kahulika mbuli za Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>avo kawalongela watumigwa zake, “Ino iyo Yohana M'batiza, kazuka kulawa mwa wanhu wadanganhike, kileka mana mhiko za kutenda mizonza zosang'hanika mgati yake.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Kwavija Helode kakala yamgogile Yohana, kamfunga nzabi na kumgela mkifungo sama ya Helodia, mtwanzi wa mkulu wake yokemigwa Filipo. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Kwavija Yohana kakala yomulongela Helode, “Kutenda gagomeswe na Malagizo ga Musa kumsola Helodia!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Helode kalonda kumkoma Yohana, ila kawadumba wanhu kwavija wakala wampetile kamba Yohana kakala muhokozi.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Muna dizua da lusona lwa ng'humbukila ya mvumbuka ya Helode, mndele wa Helodia kavina haulongozi wa iwahenza. Helode kanogelwa, <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>kamduilila na kamulongela kamba komgwelela kinhu chochose chondayapule.<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Kuno yoswagizwa na mamaake, kalonga, “Nigwelele pala da Yohana M'batiza bahano muna ulungo!”<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Mndewa kona giogio ng'hani, ila sama ya kiduilo chayaiduile na sama ya iwahenza wakalile haja, kalagiza yagweleligwe, <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>avo kalagiza pala da Yohana dikanhigwe muja mkifungo. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Pala jake digaligwa mulungo na kugweleligwa imndele, na heyo kamgalila mamaake. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Wanahina wa Yohana weza na kulusola lukuli lwake na kuluzika. Abaho, wachola kumulongela Yesu gaja galawilile.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowagwelela Mandia Wanhu Bwando</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk. 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Yesu viyahulike mbuli za Yohana, kanyelenhuka kulawa hanhu haja kakwela mngalawa kachola hanhu halibule wanhu. Ila wanhu viwahulike, walawa m'viwambo wamkoleleza na magulu. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Yesu viyahumuluke muna ingalawa, kawonela bazi na kuwahonya wanhu zao wakalile watamu.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Viivikile ichungulo wanahina wamcholela wamulongela, “Zua diswa na hano twa mkiwala, avo walongele iwanhu wachole m'viwambo wakaigulile mandia.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Yesu kawedika, “Hawalondigwa wachole, wagweleleni mweye kinhu cha kuja!”<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Na hewo wamulongela, “Hano twabule kinhu ila mikate mitano na somba wabili viiyeka.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Vigaleni hano hamwangu.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Kawalagiza wanhu wakale hasi muluzondo, abaho, kaisola imikate mitano na iwasomba wabili, kalola kuulanga, na kumuheweza Mulungu. Abaho kaimogola imikate, kawagwelela wanahina, na wanahina wawagwelela iwanhu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Wose waja na kwiguta. Abaho wanahina wadondola vidanga va imikate na iwasomba visigale, wamemeza vigelo longo dimwe na vibili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Mheta ya wanhu wadile imikate wakala wambigalo alufu tano, uhaleka watwanzi na wana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kotembela Uchana ya Gamazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mlk. 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoh. 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalagiza wanahina wakwele muna ingalawa wamulongole mwambu uyagwe wa idilamba, kipigiti heyo vayakalile yowalaga wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Viyamambukize kuwalaga, kakwela hakigongo yeiyeka kutambika. Na zua vidiswele, Yesu kakala hiko yeiyeka. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Ila kipigiti kino ingalawa ikala kutali na iisi inyalile, ikunhizwa na mawimbi kwavija beho dikala dolawa kuulongozi wa ingalawa.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Mkipigiti cha nzogolo zikwika Yesu kawacholela wanahina zake, yotembela uchana ya igamazi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Wanahina viwamuwene yotembela uchana ya igamazi, wona bwembwe, walonga, “Mzimu!” Waguta nyangi kuno wogudema.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Bahaja Yesu kawalongela, “Gangamaleni! Iyo nene, sambimdumbe!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Petulo kamulongela, “Mndewa, kamba iyo gweye, nilagize nitembele uchana ya gamazi nize kumwako.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Izo!” Avo Petulo kahumuluka muna ingalawa, na kutembela uchana ya gamazi, na kumcholela Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Ila viyadiwene dibeho, kadumba, na kusonga kudidimila muna gamazi, kaguta nyangi yolonga, “Mndewa, nikombole!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Bahaja Yesu kagolosa mkono wake, kamgoga kamulongela, “Gweye uli na nhamanila ndodo! Habali usinha?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Na viwakwelile muna ingalawa, dibeho dinyamala. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Wose wakalile muna ingalawa wamtambikila walonga, “Kweli gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowahonya Watamu ako Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mlk. 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Viweshile kuloka idilamba, wavika kuna iisi ya Genesaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Wanhu wa hiko viwamtangile Yesu, wabwililisa mbuli zake m'viwambo vose vili mmambwegambwega, na wamgalila wanhu wose wakalile watamu. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Wamuyalalila kamba yawaleke wanhu wakalile watamu wakwase lugigo lwa guo jake, na wose walukwasile wahona.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Nzoela za Wahenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mlk. 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Abaho, Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa kulawa Yelusalemu wamcholela Yesu, wamuuza, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Habali wanahina zako hawaziwinza nzoela za wahenga zetu? Kwavija wahalonda kuja hawasuluza makono gao!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yesu kawedika, “Na mweye habali muileka ndagizi ya Mulungu sama ya nzoela yenu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Kwavija Mulungu kalonga, ‘Wahishimile tataako na mamaako,’ na ‘Munhu yoyose yomulonga vihile tataake ama mamaake, yakomigwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Ila mweye molonga kamba, mduhu mbuli munhu yahamulongela tataake ama mamaake kamba, ‘Sidaha kuwagwelela kinhu chochose kwavija niiduila kamba vinhu vinilondile kuwagwelela mweye nivilave ha Mulungu,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>Avo, mmbuli zino mowalongela wanhu sambiwawahishimile watata na wamama zao. Avo muizabuza mbuli ya Mulungu sama ya kuiwinza nzoela yenu. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Videlenya mweye, muhokozi Isaya kahokola goya yowalonga mweye haja viyalongile,<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>‘Mulungu kalonga, “Wanhu wano wonihishimila nie mmilomo yao,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">ila mioyo yao yakutali na nie.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Wonitambikila nie bule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">kwavija wofundiza mafundo ga wanhu kamba Malagizo gangu!” ’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vinhu Vimtenda Munhu Yanyolodoke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mlk. 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Abaho, Yesu kadikema didale da wanhu na kudilongela, “Tegelezeni na kuvitanga! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Haduhu kinhu chondakingile mmulomo wa munhu chondakimtende yanyolodoke, ila munhu konyolodoswa na mbuli zilawa mmulomo wake.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Abaho, wanahina wamcholela wamulongela, “Kuvitanga kamba Mafalisayo wehilwa viwazihulike mbuli zuulongile?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Yesu kawalongela, “M'biki wowose hauhandigwe na Tataangu wa kuulanga wong'oligwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Walekeni! Hewo wawo vilangizi vimbugumbugu wowalongoza vimbugumbugu wayao. Na kamba kimbugumbugu yahamulongoza kimbugumbugu miyage, wose wolagalila mdikolongo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Petulo kamulongela, “Tulongele nhegulo ya hala dino.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Vivija na mweye mng'hali hamnavitanga? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Ham'vitanga kamba kinhu chochose kingila mmulomo, chokwingila mmunda, abaho, cholawa hanze ya ulukuli? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Ila mbuli zilawa mmulomo, zolawa muna umoyo, na mbuli zino zizo zimtenda munhu yanyolodoke. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Kwavija kulawa mmoyo zolawa ngelegeza zihile, kukoma, ugoni, ushalati, ubavi, usindila wa uvwizi, na kuilonga vihile. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Gano gago gomtenda munhu yanyolodoke, ila kuja bila kusuluza makono, hakumtenda munhu yanyolodoke.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mtwanzi Yali na Nhamanila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mlk. 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yesu kahalawa hanhu haja, kachola kuziisi za Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Na mtwanzi imwe Mkanaani, kulawa muisi ija, kamcholela. Kenula dizwi, kamulongela, “Mndewa, Mwana wa Daudi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mwana wa Daudi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kolawa mulukolo lwa Mndewa Daudi.</char></note> nyonela bazi! Mndele wangu kogazigwa ng'hani na kinyamkela.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Ila Yesu hamwidike. Wanahina zake wamcholela wamuyalalila, wolonga, “Muleke yachole! Kwavija kotutoela nyangi kuchugu chetu!”<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Yesu kalonga, “Nie nitumigwa sama ya ng'hondolo wapotele wa isi ya Islaeli.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Ija mtwanzi kamcholela Yesu na kumfugamila mavindi kamulongela, “Mndewa, nhaza!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Yesu kedika, “Havilumbile kusola mandia ga wana na kuwasila umbwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Ija mtwanzi kamulongela, “Ona, Mndewa, ila hata umbwa woja mandia gasigale galagale hasi kulawa haimeza ya mndewa wao.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Abaho, Yesu kamulongela, “Gweye mtwanzi, nhamanila yako ng'hulu! Na iwe kumwako kamba vuulonda.” Na kipigiti kikija mndele wake kahona.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowahonya Wanhu Bwando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Yesu kahalawa haja, kabita mumgwazo wa Idilamba da Galilaya. Kakwela hakigongo, kakala hasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Wanhu bwando wamcholela, wamgalila walemale, vimbugumbugu, mbetembete, bubui, na wayagwe bwando, na kuweka haulongozi wa Yesu, na heyo kawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Wanhu wakanganya viwawawene mabubui wolonga, walemale wahonyigwa, mbetembete wotembela, na vimbugumbugu wolola. Wamuyenzi Mulungu wa Islaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowagwelela Mandia Wanhu Bwando Wayagwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mlk. 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Yesu kawakema wanahina zake kawalongela, “Nowonela bazi wanhu wano, kwavija wakala na nie mazua madatu na sambi wabule kinhu cha kuja kisigale. Na nie silonda niwaleke wachole na nzala, sambiweze kusinduka mnzila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Wanahina zake wamulongela, “Kwahi kondatupate mandia ga kuwegutiza wanhu bwando kamba wano mkiwala kino?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yesu kawauza, “Mikate mingahi imulinayo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Wamulongela, “Mikate saba na visomba vidogodogo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Avo Yesu kawalagiza waja iwanhu wakale hasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Kaisola imikate saba na ivisomba, kamuheweza Mulungu, abaho, kaimogola na kuwagwelela wanahina, na wanahina wadigwelela didale da wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Wose waja na kwiguta. Abaho, wanahina wadondola vidanga va imikate na ivisomba visigale, wamemeza migelo saba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Wanhu wose wadile wakala wambigalo alufu nne uhaleka watwanzi na wana.<verse eid="MAT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Yesu viyeshile kudilaga didale da wanhu, kakwela muna ingalawa, kachola kuisi ya Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Wanhu Wolonda Kilaguso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mlk. 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk. 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Mafalisayo na Masadukayo wamcholela Yesu, wamgeza mkumulonda yawalagusile kilaguso kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ihavika ichungulo, molonga, ‘Kowa na mchesa, kwavija ulanga mdung'hu.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Na imitondo molonga, ‘Lelo kowa na mvula, kwavija ulanga una udung'hu na utitu.’ Mweye movitanga kuzuza vinhu vikoneka kuulanga, ila hamudahile kuzuza vilaguso va vipigiti vino! <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Mulelo wihile na uleka kumtamanila Mulungu! Wolonda kilaguso! Ila hawagweleligwa kilaguso, ila kilaguso cha muhokozi Yona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Abaho, Yesu kawaleka, kachola.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mela da Mafalisayo na Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mlk. 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Wanahina viwavikile mwambu uyagwe wa idilamba, wavitanga kamba waisemwa kusola mikate. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Loleni na muiteganye na mela da Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Wailongela wenyego kwa wenyego, wolonga, “Kalonga vino kwavija tuleka kusola mikate.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Yesu kagatanga gaja gawakalile wolonga, na heyo kawalongela, “Mweye wanhu muli na nhamanila ndodo, habali mulongelela mbuli za kuwa bule mikate? <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Mng'hali hamnavitanga? Muisemwa ija imikate mitano iwadile wambigalo alufu tano, na mkunzanya vigelo vingahi vimemile? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Ama ija imikate saba iwadile wambigalo alufu nne, na mkunzanya migelo mingahi imemile? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Vilihi ham'vitanga kamba sikalile nilonga na mweye mmbuli ya mikate? Iteganyeni na mela da Mafalisayo na Masadukayo!” <verse eid="MAT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Abaho, wavitanga kamba Yesu hakalile yowazuma waiteganye na mela da kugela mmikate, ila waiteganye na mafundo ga Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petulo Komulonga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mlk. 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk. 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Yesu kachola kuisi ili behi na wambo da Kaisalia Filipi, kawauza wanahina zake, “Wanhu wolonga kamba Mwana wa Munhu iyo yalihi?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Wamwidika wamulongela, “Wayagwe wolonga Yohana M'batiza, wayagwe wolonga Eliya, na wayagwe wolonga Yelemia ama imwe wa wahokozi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Yesu kawauza, “Ila na mweye molonga nie iyo yalihi?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simoni Petulo kamwidika, “Gweye iyo Kilisto, Mwana wa Mulungu yali na ugima.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Kumota Simoni, mwana wa Yohana! Kwavija haduhu munhu yakugubulile gano, ila Tataangu wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Nokulongela kamba gweye iyo Petulo, na mdibwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Petulo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake Mkigiliki </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dibwe.</char></note> dino nodizenga kanisa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kanisa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wanhu wamtogole Kilisto.</char></note> jangu, na mhiko za kuzimu hazidaha kudihuma. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Nokugwelela vivugulilo va Undewa wa Kuulanga, chochose chondaukifunge muna iisi, chofungigwa kuulanga. Na chochose chondaukifungule muna iisi, chofunguligwa kuulanga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Abaho, Yesu kawazuma wanahina zake kamba sambiwamulongele munhu yoyose kamba heyo iyo Kilisto.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kolonga Vija Vondayagaye na Kudanganhika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mlk. 8:31—9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk. 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Songela kipigiti kija Yesu kasonga kuwalongela wanahina zake, “Nolondigwa nichole Yelusalemu, na hiko nogazigwa na wavyele, na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko, na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Nokomigwa, ila gahabita mazua madatu nozuka kulawa mkudanganhika.”<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Petulo kamsola kamgala hamgwazo na kusonga kumkomhokela yolonga, “Sambiiwe vino, Mndewa! Mbuli hiyo haikulawila gweye!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Yesu kahinduka kamulongela Petulo, “Bwela kuchugu changu, Mwenembago! Gweye kwa king'hwaso kumwangu nie, kwavija hugelegeza ga Mulungu, ila kogelegeza ga wanhu.” <verse eid="MAT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Kamba munhu yahalonda kuwa mwanahina wangu, yaibele mwenyego, yaidikwe msalaba wake yanikoleleze. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Munhu yoyose yahalonda kuukombola ugima wake, kowagiza, na munhu yoyose yowagiza ugima wake sama yangu nie, koukombola. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Kinhu chaki kinogile munhu chondayakipate kamba yahaupata ulumwengu wose, na kuwagiza ugima wake uli muloho? Ama kinhu chaki chondayalave giladi yabwezelwe ugima wake uli muloho? <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Kwavija nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nokwiza na wasenga zangu wa Mulungu wa kuulanga muna iyenzi ya Tataangu, abaho, nomuliha kila munhu kamba vija viyasang'hane. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Nowalongela ikweli, hana wanhu wayagwe wemile hano hawadanganhika mbaka vondawanyone nie Mwana wa Munhu, nikwiza muna Uundewa wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Kugaluka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mlk. 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk. 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Vigabitile mazua sita Yesu kawasola Petulo, Yakobo, na Yohana ndugu yake Yakobo kakwela nao kukigongo kitali weiyeka. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Yesu kagaluka haulongozi wao, na kihanga chake kinang'hazika kamba zua, na vivalo vake vikala vizelu kamba mulangaza. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Bahaja, walawililwa na Musa na Eliya, wolonga na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Petulo kamulongela Yesu, “Mndewa, vinoga tweye tukale hano! Na uhalonda nozenga vizewe vidatu, kimwe chako, kimwe cha Musa, na kiyagwe cha Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Viyakalile yang'hali yolonga, wingu zelu diwagubika, na dihulikwa dizwi kulawa mdiwingu dilonga, “Ino iyo Mwanangu yanogele, mtegelezeni heyo!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Wanahina viwahulike vino, wagwa kingubanguba, wona bwembwe ng'hani. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Yesu kawacholela, abaho, kawakwasa kawalongela, “Gandamukeni, sambimdumbe!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Na viwalolile uchana, hawamuwene munhu yoyose ila Yesu yeiyeka.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Viwahumuluke haikigongo, Yesu kawalagiza yolonga, “Sambimmulongele munhu yoyose gaja gamgawene, mbaka nie, Mwana wa Munhu, vondanizuke kulawa mkudanganhika.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Abaho, wanahina wamuuza Yesu, “Habali wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wolonga kamba tanhu Eliya yeze?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Kweli, Eliya kokwiza kwika goya vinhu vose. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Ila nowalongela, Eliya keza kesha, na hewo hawamtambule, ila wamtendela vija viwalondile. Vivija na heyo Mwana wa Munhu kogazigwa mmakono gao.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Abaho, wanahina wavitanga kamba kakala yowalongela mbuli za Yohana M'batiza.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Mmhale Yali na Kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mlk. 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luk. 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Viwavikile hana ididale da wanhu, munhu imwe kamcholela Yesu kamfugamila mavindi, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>kamulongela, “Mndewa, monele bazi mmhale wangu, kwavija kana kisango na kugazika ng'hani. Mianza bwando kalagalila hamoto ama mgamazi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Nimgala ha wanahina zako, ila walemelwa kumuhonya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye wanhu mwihile, mulibule nhamanila, nokala na mweye mbaka zua jaki? Nowazaganya mbaka zua jaki? Mgaleni hano hamwangu!” <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Yesu kamkomhokela ija ikinyamkela, na ikinyamkela kamulawa immhale, na heyo kipigiti kikija kahona.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Abaho, wanahina wamwizila Yesu kinyele, wamuuza, “Habali tweye tulemelwa kumuwinga?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Kwavija muhungukilwa na nhamanila! Nowalongela ikweli, kamba muhawa na nhamanila ndodo kamba mbeyu ya haladali, modaha kukilongela kigongo kino, ‘Segela hano uchole haja!’ Na ikigongo chosegela. Haduhu kinhu chochose chondamulemelwe kutenda!” <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>Ila kinyamkela kamba ino havidahika kulawa, ila mkutambika na kufunga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zabule mnhongo wa 21.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kolonga Mwanza Uyagwe Vija Vondayadanganhike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk. 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk. 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Wanahina viwaiting'hane hamoja ako Galilaya, Yesu kawalongela, “nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu, <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>wonikoma, ila gahabita mazua madatu nozuka.” Wanahina wanyunguala ng'hani.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuliha Kodi ya Ng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Yesu na wanahina zake viwavikile Kapenaumu, wawila kodi wa Ng'anda ya Mulungu wamcholela Petulo wamuuza, “Mkulufunzi wako kalihaga kodi ya Ng'anda ya Mulungu?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Petulo kawedika, “Ona, kalihaga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Petulo viyengile mng'anda, Yesu kakala waichanduso kulonga nayo, “Simoni, gweye kokonaze? Wandewa wa isi wowila kodi kulawa ha wanhu walihi? Kulawa ha wenekae ama kulawa ha wahenza?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Petulo kamulongela, “Kulawa ha wahenza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Abaho, Yesu kamulongela, “Kulonga goya, kwavija wenekae hawalondigwa kuliha kodi. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Giladi sambituwagevuze, avo genda hana dilamba ukase nduwano, abaho, msole somba yondayalongole kunamata, na uhaunanazula mulomo wake, kovika hela, abaho, isole ukanilihile nie na gweye mwenyego.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Yalihi Yali Mkulu Kubanza Wose?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mlk. 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk. 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Kipigiti kija wanahina wamcholela Yesu wamuuza, “Yalihi yali mkulu kubanza wose muna Uundewa wa Kuulanga?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Yesu kamkema mwana mdodo, abaho, kamwika haulongozi wao, <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>kalonga, “Nowalongela ikweli, ihawa hamulonda kugaluka na kulinga kamba wana wadodo, hamdaha kwingila muna Uundewa wa Kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Munhu yoyose yokiihumulusa kamba mwana ino, iyo mkulu kubanza wose muna Uundewa wa Kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Na munhu yoyose yom'bokela mwana mdodo kamba ino mtwaga jangu, konibokela nie.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vinhu Vimtenda Munhu Yengile M'vilozo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mlk. 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk. 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>“Ihawa munhu yoyose yahamtenda imwe wa wanhu wano wadodo yatende vilozo, vihanogile munhu hiyo yafungigwe msingo yake dibwe kulu da kusiginhila na kwasigwa mkilindi cha bahali. <figure style="fig" alt="large millstone" file="NT-01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" loc="Matthew 18:6" copy="Jonathan McDaniel" ref="Mat. 18:6">Dibwe Kulu da Kusiginhila</figure> <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Ulumwengu wojona sama ya ving'hwaso viwatenda wanhu wengile m'vilozo! Kwavija ving'hwaso havidahika kuleka kulawilila, ila kojona munhu ija yotenda ving'hwaso vilawilile!<verse eid="MAT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>“Ihawa mkono wako ama mgulu wako wokutenda utende vilozo, ukanhe, uwase kutali na gweye! Vinoga wingile muna ugima wa digunge kuno ulemale ama uli mbetembete, kubanza kuwa na makono mabili ama magulu mabili, abaho, wasigwe muna umoto wa digunge. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Na kamba siso jako dokutenda utende vilozo, ding'ole, ujase! Vinoga wingile muna uugima wa digunge na siso dimwe, kubanza kuwa na meso mabili, abaho, wasigwe muna umoto wa kuzimu.<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Ng'hondolo Yapotele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk. 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>“Teganyeni! Sambimumzabuze imwe wa wanhu wano wadodo. Nowalongela kamba, wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga wali hamoja nao mazua gose wa behi na Tataangu wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>Kwavija Mwana wa Munhu keza kuwakombola waja wapotele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zabule mnhongo wa 11.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>“Mokonaze, kamba munhu yahawa na ng'hondolo mia, abaho, ng'hondolo imwe yahapotela, vino hawaleka waja ng'hondolo malongo tisa na tisa wasigale mkigongo na kuchola kumzahila ija ng'hondolo imwe yapotele? <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Nowalongela ikweli, kamba yahamona, komdeng'hela ng'hani kubanza waja ng'hondolo malongo tisa na tisa walekile kupotela. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Vivija na Tata wenu wa kuulanga halonda hata munhu imwe wa wano wadodo yapotele.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kumzuma Munhu Yatendile Vilozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>“Ihawa ndugu yako kakutenda gehile, genda ukamulongele kija kinhu kihile chayakutendile muli wabili mwiyeka. Na kamba kokutegeleza, kumpata kabili ndugu yako. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Ila kamba hakutegeleze, msole munhu imwe ama wabili wayagwe hamoja na gweye, giladi mmbuli za wasindila wabili ama wadatu kila kinhu kitangigwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Na kamba hawategeleze, walongele wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, na vivija yahalema kuwategeleza, avo umone kamba Mmhazi na muwila kodi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufunga na Kufungula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>“Nowalongela ikweli, chochose chondamkifunge muna iisi, chofungigwa kuulanga. Na chochose chondamkifungule muna iisi, chofunguligwa kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>“Vivija, nowalongela ikweli, kamba wabili mmwanza wenu muna iisi wahaitogolela mmbuli ya kinhu chochose chowopula, wotendeligwa na Tataangu wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Kwavija hawali wabili ama wadatu waiting'hane mtwaga jangu, na nie na hamoja nao.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mtumigwa Yoleka Kumgela Kumgongo Miyage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Abaho, Petulo kamcholela Yesu kamuuza, “Mndewa, kamba ndugu yangu yahanitenda vilozo, nimgele kumgongo mianza mingahi? Hata mianza saba?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Sikulongela mianza saba, ila mianza malongo saba mala saba. <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>Kwavija Undewa wa Kuulanga ulinga na mndewa imwe yalondile kuwakagula watumigwa zake wakalile wamkopile hela. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Viyasongile kukagula, kagaliligwa munhu yakalile yowilwa talanta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Talanta imwe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hela ya kitumetume cha milao 15.</char></note> alufu longo dimwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Ija imtumigwa hakalile na cha kuliha, avo mndewa kalagiza kamba yaguzwe heyo na mtwanzi wake na wanage na kila kinhu kiyali nacho, giladi yalihe hela ziyakalile yowilwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Avo ija imtumigwa kamfugamila mavindi kamuyalalila kamulongela, ‘Mndewa, nyalize, nokuliha hela zako zose!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Mndewa wa imtumigwa ija kamonela bazi, avo kamgela kumgongo deni jake jose, abaho, kamuleka yachole.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>“Abaho, ija imunhu viyacholile, kaiting'hana na mtumigwa miyage yakalile yomuwila dinali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dinali imwe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hela ya kitumetume cha zua dimwe. </char></note> mia. Kamgoga na kusonga kumfida msingo, kalonga, ‘Nilihe deni jangu!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Ija imtumigwa miyage kamfugamila mavindi kamuyalalila kamulongela, ‘Nyalize, nokuliha deni jako jose!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Ila heyo kalema, avo kachola, kamgela mkifungo mbaka vondayalihe hela zose ziyakalile yowilwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Watumigwa wayage viwawene gaja galawilile, wona giogio, avo wachola, wamulongela mndewa wao mbuli zose zilawilile. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Abaho, ija imndewa kamkema kamulongela, ‘Gweye kwa mtumigwa wihile! Nie nikugela kumgongo deni jako jose kwavija vuuniyalalile. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Vino hulondigwe na gweye kumonela bazi mtumigwa miyago kamba nie vinikonele bazi?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Mndewa wake kona lusango, avo kamgoga, kamgela mkifungo mbaka vondayalihe dideni.<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>“Vino vivo Tataangu wa kuulanga vondayawatende mweye ahaja munhu mmwanza wenu yahalema kumgela kumgongo ndugu yake, kulawa mmoyo wake.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kofundiza Mbuli za Nyasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mlk. 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Yesu viyamambukize kulonga mbuli zino, kalawa Galilaya kachola kuna iisi ya Yudea mwambu uyagwe wa Ulwanda lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Wanhu bwando wamkweleleza, na heyo kawahonya hiko.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Mafalisayo wamcholela na kumgeza mkumuuza, “Malagizo ga Musa gomtogoza munhu kumwasa mtwanzi wake mmbuli yoyose?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino, hamsomile Mzinyandiko Zing'alile? Ahaja hazilonga kamba haichanduso Mulungu kawalumba mtwanzi na mbigalo. <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>Na heyo kalonga, ‘Mkilamso kino mbigalo kowaleka tataake na mamaake na kuilumba na mwehe wake, na wabili wano wowa lukuli lumwe.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">MWANDUSO 2:24</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Avo sio wabili, ila lukuli lumwe. Kwavija kiyalumbile Mulungu, haduhu munhu yondayakimamazule.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Mafalisayo wamuuza, “Habali Musa kalonga Mmalagizo gake kamba munhu kodaha kumgwelela mtwanzi wake lupwilili lwa nyasa na kumwasa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Musa kawatogoza muwase watwanzi zenu sama ya udala wa mioyo yenu. Ila haikalile vino songela haichanduso. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Nowalongela kamba, mbigalo yoyose yomwasa mtwanzi wake na kumsola mtwanzi iyagwe kotenda ugoni. Ila munhu yahamwasa mtwanzi wake sama ya kutenda ugoni kodaha kusola mtwanzi iyagwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zongeza mbuli zino, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Na ayo yondayamsole mtwanzi ija yasigwe kotenda ugoni.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Wanahina zake wamulongela, “Ihawa vino vivo ili ha mbigalo na mtwanzi wake, vinoga kuleka kusola.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Yesu kawedika kawalongela, “Sio wanhu wose wodaha kuitogola mbuli ino, ila ha waja wose wagweleligwe motelo ino na Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Kwavija hana vibohola<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Vibohola </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wambigalo walibule kimbigalo.</char></note> wali hivo songela viwavumbuke, na hana vibohola watendigwe na wanhu, na wayagwe woleka kusola sama ya Undewa wa Kuulanga. Munhu yodaha kugabokela gano, yagabokele.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowamoteza Wana Wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk. 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk. 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Abaho, wana wadodo wagaligwa ha Yesu giladi yawekile makono na kuwatambikila, ila wanahina wawakomhokela waja wawagalile. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Yesu kalonga, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kumwangu, sambimuwagomese, kwavija Undewa wa Kuulanga uli wa wanhu wali kamba wano.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Avo, kawekila makono gake kuwamoteza, abaho, kachola.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmhale Mgoli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk. 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk. 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Baho mmhale imwe kamcholela Yesu kamuuza, “Mkulufunzi, nitende kinhu chaki kinogile giladi ningile muugima wa digunge?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Habali uniuza mbuli ya kinhu kinogile? Hana imwe yeiyeka iyo yanogile. Uhalonda kwingila muugima wa digunge, zigoge ndagizi za Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Ija immhale kauza, “Ndagizi zaki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesu kamwidika, “Sambiukome, sambiutende ugoni, sambiwibe, sambiulave usindila wa uvwizi, <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>wahishimile tataako na mamaako, na mnogele munhu wa habehi nagwe kamba vuukinogela mwenyego.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Ija immhale kedika, kamulongela, “Gano gose nigagoga, nisigaza kinhu chaki?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Uhalonda sambiuhungule hanhu, genda kaguze vinhu vako, abaho, zihela uwagwelele wakumbulu, avo kowa na ngama kuulanga, abaho, izo unikoleleze.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Ija immhale viyahulike vino, kachola kuno yokona giogio, kwavija kakala mgoli.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Nowalongela ikweli, yowa vidala mgoli kwingila muna Undewa wa Kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Nowalongela mwanza uyagwe, vibuha ngamia kubita mkizonzo cha shindano, kubanza mgoli kwingila Muundewa wa Mulungu.” <figure style="fig" alt="loaded camel" file="hk00041c.jpg" size="col" loc="Mat 19:24" copy="Horace Knowles © The British and Foreign Bible Society 1954, 1967, 1972, 1995." ref="19:24">Ngamia</figure><verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Wanahina viwahulike vino, wakanganya ng'hani na kuuza, “Avo, yalihi yodaha kukomboligwa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yesu kawalola kalonga, “Mwa wanhu mbuli ino haidahika, ila ha Mulungu mbuli zose zodahika.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Abaho, Petulo kedika, kalonga, “Tweye tuleka kila kinhu tukukoleleza gweye, avo, kwiza topata choni?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ikweli, mweye mose mung'holeleze nie, muna uulumwengu wa sambi, Mwana wa Munhu vondayakale mkigoda chake cha undewa kili na yenzi, vivija na mweye mokala m'vigoda va undewa longo dimwe na vibili, muitagusa mitala longo dimwe na mibili ya Islaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Na munhu yoyose yoleka ng'anda ama ndugu ama lumbu ama tata ama mama ama wana ama migunda sama yangu, kobokela mianza mia na kuuhala ugima wa digunge. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Ila wanhu bwando wali wa haichanduso, wowa wa haikimambukizo, na wanhu bwando wali wa haikimambukizo, wowa wa haichanduso.<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Wasang'hana Mumgunda wa Mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>“Kwavija Undewa wa Kuulanga ulinga na munhu yalawile ulukwili kuchola kuzahila wanhu wa kusang'hanika mumgunda wake wa mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Waitogolela yawalihe dinali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dinali imwe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hela ya kitumetume cha zua dimwe.</char></note> mdizua dimwe, abaho, kawatuma kusang'hanika mumgunda wake wa mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Mkipigiti cha saa ndatu kachola kabili, kawona wanhu wayagwe wemile hadisoko walibule sang'hano ya kutenda, <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>avo kawalongela, ‘Na mweye gendeni mkasang'hanike mumgunda wa mizabibu, nowaliha kilondigwa kulihigwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Avo wachola. Mkipigiti cha saa sita na saa tisa kachola kabili, katenda vivija. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Na mkipigiti cha saa longo dimwe na imwe, kachola na kuwavika wanhu wayagwe wema, avo kawauza, ‘Habali mwimile hano songela imitondo bila kutenda sang'hano yoyose?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Waja wanhu wamulongela, ‘Kwavija haduhu munhu yatugwelele sang'hano ya kutenda.’ Ija imunhu kawalongela, ‘Gendeni na mweye mkasang'hanike mumgunda wa mizabibu.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>“Viivikile ichungulo, mwene mgunda kamulongela salange wake, ‘Wakeme wasang'hana, abaho, walihe maliho gao, songa na waja wasongile kusang'hanika ichungulo, abaho, umambukizile na waja wasongile kusang'hanika imitondo.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Na waja wose wasongile kusang'hanika ichungulo, kila munhu kalihigwa dinali. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Viwezile waja wasongile kusang'hanika imitondo, wagiza kamba wolihigwa dinali bwando, ila vivija na hewo walihigwa dinali imwe kila munhu. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Wabokela dinali zao, abaho, wasonga kumtwanganikila mwene mgunda, <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>walonga, ‘Wanhu wano wa ikimambukizo wasang'hanika saa dimwe diiyeka, ila kuwaliha kamba vuutulihile tweye tusang'hanike mdizua kali na kugaya misi yose!’<verse eid="MAT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>“Mwene mgunda kamwidika munhu imwe mmwanza wao, kalonga, ‘Mbwiga, sikutendele kinhu chochose kihile! Hatuitogolele kusang'hanika mdizua dimwe kwa dinali imwe? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Sola maliho gako uchole. Nisagula kumgwelela ino waikimambukizo kamba vinikugwelele gweye. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Vino sidaha kutenda vija vinilonda na hela zangu mwenyego? Ama kokona migongo kwavija vinili na moyo unogile?’<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>“Avo, wali wa haikimambukizo wowa wa haichanduso, na wali wa haichanduso wowa wa haikimambukizo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kolonga Mwanza wa Ikadatu Vija Vondayadanganhike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk. 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk. 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Yesu viyakalile yochola Yelusalemu, mnzila kawasola wanahina longo dimwe na wabili hamgwazo weiyeka, na kuwalongela, <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>“Tochola Yelusalemu, na Mwana wa Munhu kogeligwa mmakono ga wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Womtagusa kudanganhika, <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>abaho, kogeligwa mmakono ga Wamhazi, womtendela uponela, womulanha mbalati, na womuwamba mumsalaba, ila mdizua da ikadatu kozuka.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mama wa Yakobo na Yohana Kopula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mlk. 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Abaho, mama wa wana wa Zebedayo kamcholela Yesu hamoja na wanage, kamfugamila mavindi giladi yapule kinhu.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Kolonda choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Ija imtwanzi kamwidika yolonga, “Lagiza kamba wanangu wano wabili, imwe yakale mkono wako wa ukulume na iyagwe yakale mkono wako wa ukumoso muna Undewa wako.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Hammanyile kinhu chumpula. Modaha kuking'wela kikasi cha mgayo kinilondigwa kuking'wela nie?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Wamwidika walonga, “Todaha.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Moking'wela kikasi cha migayo kining'wela nie, ila kukala kumkono wangu wa ukulume na wa ukumoso sio sang'hano yangu. Ila hanhu aho wekiligwa waja wose watandiligwe na Tataangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Wanahina wayagwe longo dimwe viwahulike vino, wawonela lusango Yakobo na Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Ila Yesu kawakema hamoja kawalongela, “Movitanga kamba wandewa wa Wamhazi wowatawala na mhiko, na wakulu zao wana udaho mwa wanhu zao. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Sambiiwe vino kumwenu. Ila munhu yoyose mmwanza wenu yahalonda kuwa mkulu, kolondigwa yawe mtumigwa wenu. <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>Na munhu yoyose mmwanza wenu yahalonda kuwa waichanduso, kolondigwa yawe nyakadala wenu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Kwavija Mwana wa Munhu hezile kusang'hanikilwa, ila kusang'hanikila wayagwe, na kulava ugima wake giladi yawakombole wanhu bwando.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowahonya Vimbugumbugu Wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk. 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk. 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Yesu na wanahina zake viwasegele Yeliko, wanhu bwando wamkweleleza. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Haja kukala na vimbugumbugu wabili wakalile hamgwazo wa inzila, na viwahulike kamba Yesu kobita, wenula dizwi, walonga, “Mndewa, Mwana wa Daudi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mwana wa Daudi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kolawa mulukolo lwa Mndewa Daudi.</char></note> tonele bazi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Didale da wanhu diwakomhokela na kuwalongela wanyamale. Ila wagendelela kwinula dizwi, wolonga, “Mndewa, Mwana wa Daudi, tonele bazi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Yesu kema, abaho, kawakema kawauza, “Molonda niwatendele choni?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Wamulongela, “Mndewa, tolonda tulole!”<verse eid="MAT 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Yesu kawonela bazi, kagakwasa meso gao. Bahaja wadaha kulola, abaho, wamkweleleza.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kokwingila Yelusalemu na Wila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk. 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Yesu na wanahina zake viwakalile behi na kuvika Yelusalemu, wavika mkiwambo cha Betifage hana Ikigongo cha Mizaituni, Yesu kawatuma wanahina zake wabili, <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>kawalongela, “Gendeni hana ikiwambo kili haulongozi wenu, baho mom'vika mhunda yafungigwe hamoja na mwanage. Wafunguleni, abaho, munigalile. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Na kamba munhu yoyose yahawauza, mulongeleni kamba, ‘Mndewa kowalonda.’ Na himahima kowagwelela.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Gano galawilila giladi gavikile gaja galongigwe na muhokozi, yolonga,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Mulongele mndele wa Sayuni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mndele wa Sayuni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wanhu wa Yelusalemu.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">‘Lola, Mndewa wako kokwizila!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Kahola moyo na kapapigwa na mhunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">mwana wa mhunda.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Avo, wanahina wachola na watenda kamba Yesu viyawalongele. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Wamgala imhunda na mwana wa mhunda, watandika vivalo vao uchana yao, abaho, Yesu kakala uchana ya imwana mhunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Dale kulu ng'hani da wanhu janzanza vivalo vao mnzila, na wayagwe wakanha mikuti ya mitende na kuyanzanza mnzila. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Dale da wanhu dikalile dimulongole na wose wakalile wamsondolele wenula dizwi walonga, “Yatogolwe Mwana wa Daudi! Kamota ayo yokwiza mditwaga da Mndewa! Nhogolwa uchana kuulanga!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Yesu viyengile Yelusalemu, wambo jose dikala mumzahimzahi, na wanhu wauza, “Ino iyo munhu yalihi?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Didale da wanhu diwalongela, “Ino iyo Yesu, muhokozi kulawa Nazaleti mkiwambo cha Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kochola Kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk. 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk. 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Yesu kengila mdikonhi da Ing'anda ya Mulungu na kuwawinga wanhu wose wakalile muja woguza na kugula. Kazihindula meza za wavunja hela na vigoda va wose wakalile woguza njiwa, <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>kawalongela, “Yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, ‘Ng'anda yangu yokemigwa ng'anda ya nhambiko.’ Ila mweye moitenda fisilo da wabavi!”<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Vimbugumbugu na walemale wamcholela kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu, na heyo kawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Ila wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa viwonile vinhu va mkanganyo viyatendile, na wana wotoa nyangi kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu wolonga, “Yatogolwe Mwana wa Daudi!” wona lusango. <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Wamulongela, “Kowahulika wano vowolonga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesu kawalongela, “Ona! Hamsomile gaja gandikigwe Mzinyandko Zing'alile, golonga, ‘Wana wadodo na ving'hele, wokwimba nyila za nhogolwa’?”<verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Kawaleka, kachola hanze ya idiwambo mbaka Betania, kawasa hiko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowikila Kinyulu Mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mlk. 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Imitondo ng'hani Yesu viyakalile mnzila yobwela mdiwambo, kona nzala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Kawona mtini hamgwazo wa inzila, kaukwenhukila, ila honile chochose uchana yake ila mijani iiyeka. Abaho, kaulongela, “Sambiulele mujo milao yose!” Bahaja umtini unyala.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Wanahina viwawene vino wakanganya, wauza, “Habali umtini unyala himahima?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yesu kawedika, yolonga, “Nowalongela ikweli, kamba muhawa na nhamanila bila kusinha mmioyo yenu, sio kamba modaha kutenda kija kitendigwe mumtini uno, ila vivija modaha kukilongela kigongo kino, ‘Goboka, uiyase m'bahali,’ na yotendeka. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Kamba muhawa na nhamanila, chochose chondampule mkutambika, mogweleligwa.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Udaho wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk. 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk. 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Yesu viyengile muna Ing'anda ya Mulungu, wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wavyele wa wanhu wamcholela kipigiti viyakalile yofundiza, wamuuza, “Kotenda mbuli zino na udaho ulihi? Na yalihi yakugwelele udaho uno?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Vivija na nie nowauza mbuli, na kamba muhanilongela nhegulo yake, na nie nowalongela kamba notenda mbuli zino na udaho ulihi. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Mbatiza ya Yohana ilawa kwahi? Ilawa ha Mulungu ama ilawa ha wanhu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Wakiiuza wenyego kwa wenyego, walonga, “Tuhalonga, ‘Ulawa ha Mulungu,’ kotuuza, ‘Habali hamumtogole?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Ila tuhalonga, ‘Ulawa ha wanhu,’ towadumba wanhu kwavija wanhu wose wotogola kamba Yohana kakala muhokozi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Avo wamwidika Yesu, “Hatuvitanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Abaho, na heyo kawalongela, “Na nie siwalongela kamba notenda mbuli zino na udaho ulihi.<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Wamhale Wabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>“Mweye mokonaze? Kukala na munhu imwe yakalile na wana wabili. Kamcholela ija imkulu kamulongela, ‘Mwanangu, lelo genda ukasang'hanike mumgunda wa mizabibu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Ija imwana kamwidika kamulongela, ‘Sichola,’ ila mkipigiti kidodo kagelegeza mmoyo wake, abaho, kachola. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Abaho, kamcholela imdodo kamulongela vivija. Na heyo kamwidika kalonga, ‘Ona, nochola, tata,’ ila hacholile. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Yalihi mmwanza wa wano wabili yatendile gamnogele tataake?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Wamwidika wamulongela, “Ija imkulu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ikweli, wawila kodi na watenda ugoni ndwanga wowalongola kwingila muna Undewa wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Kwavija Yohana M'batiza keza kumwenu mnzila ilibule uzenzeleganye, na mweye hamumtogole, ila wawila kodi na watenda ugoni ndwanga wamtogola. Na hata vimgawene gano, hamulekile vilozo venu na kumtogola.<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Walimi wa Mgunda wa Mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk. 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk. 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>“Tegelezeni hala diyagwe, kukala na munhu yakalile na mgunda wa mizabibu, kauzengela konhi na kuhimba lwingila lwa kukamulila zabibu na kuzenga ulingo. Abaho, kawapangiza walimi, kachola isi ya kutali. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Kipigiti cha kuhuna zizabibu vikivikile, kawatuma nyakadala zake ha iwalimi wakamsolele fungu jake da izizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Iwalimi wawanwang'hula waja iwanyakadala, imwe wamtoa, iyagwe wamkoma, na iyagwe wamtoa na mabwe mbaka kadanganhika. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Abaho, ija imunhu kawatuma mwanza uyagwe nyakadala wayagwe bwando kubanza waja wa ichanduso, na iwalimi wawatendela vivija kamba viwawatendele waja wa ichanduso. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Hakimambukizo, kamulagiza mwanage ha iwalimi, yolonga, ‘Kwa vovose womuhishimila mwanangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Ila iwalimi viwamuwene imwana, wailongela wenyego kwa wenyego, ‘Ino iyo muhazi. Izoni tumkome, abaho, tusole uhazi wake!’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Avo wamsola na kumwasa hanze ya umgunda wa mizabibu na kumkoma.<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>“Avo mwene mgunda yeheza, kowatenda choni iwalimi?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Wamulongela, “Kowakoma wanhu waja wehile, na kuwagwelela umgunda walimi wayagwe wondawamgwelele zabibu mkipigiti cha kuhuna.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Hamsomile Zinyandiko Zing'alile?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Dibwe dilemigwe na wazenzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">digaluka dibwe da kutamanilwa ng'hani kubanza mabwe gose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Mndewa iyo yatendile mbuli ino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">nayo iwa mkanganyo mmeso getu!’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">ZABULI 118:22-23</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>“Avo nowalongela, Undewa wa Mulungu wosegezigwa kumwenu na kugweleligwa wanhu wayagwe wondawatende gamnogele Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Munhu yodilagalila dibwe dino kobeneka vidangavidanga, na munhu yoyose yondadimulagalile domsiginha lipilipi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na Mafalisayo viwahulike hala da Yesu, wavitanga kamba kowalonga hewo, <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>avo wazahila nzila ya kumgoga. Ila wadumba didale da wanhu kwavija wakala womtogola Yesu kamba muhokozi.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Lusona lwa Zengele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk. 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yesu kawalongela mmahala mwanza uyagwe, yolonga, <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>“Undewa wa Kuulanga ulinga na mndewa yatandile lusona lwa zengele lwa mwanage. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Kawatuma nyakadala zake wakawakeme waja wagonekigwe mulusona lwa zengele, ila walema kwiza. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Abaho, kawatuma nyakadala wayagwe, kawalongela, ‘Walongeleni wanhu wose wagonekigwe kamba nitanda mandia gangu. Ng'ombe zangu iwakulu na iwadodo wanonile wesha kuchinjigwa, na kila kinhu kisasaligwa. Izoni hana ulusona lwa zengele!’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Ila hawasinhuke. Wachola na zao, imwe kachola kumgunda, na iyagwe kachola kuuchuluzi wake. <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>Wayagwe wawagoga nyakadala zake, wawaliga na kuwakoma. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Ija imndewa kona lusango, avo kawatuma asikali zake wawabanange waja wakomaji na kudisoma wambo jao. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Abaho, kawalongela nyakadala zake, ‘Lusona lwa zengele lusasaligwa, ila wanhu wagonekigwe hawalumbile kuvika. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Avo gendeni mzinzilamhanda za mkiwambo mkawagoneke wanhu wondamuwawene weze kulusona lwa zengele.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Avo waja iwanyakadala wachola muna zinzila za mkiwambo na kuwalundiza wanhu wose wawavikile, wanogile na wehile, na dibugano da lusona lwa zengele dimema wahenza.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>“Ila ija imndewa viyengile kuwalola iwahenza, kamona munhu haja yalekile kuvala vivalo va lusona lwa zengele. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Kamuuza, ‘Mbwiga, kwingilaze hano bila vivalo va lusona lwa zengele?’ Ija imunhu kanyamala. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Abaho, imndewa kawalongela watumigwa, ‘Mfungeni makono na magulu, abaho, mmwase kunze mdiziza. Ako kowa na kililo na kugegedula meno.’<verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>“Kwavija wanhu bwando wagonekigwe, ila wasaguligwe wadodo.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Kuliha Kodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk. 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk. 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Mafalisayo waiting'hana hamoja na kumwikila zundo Yesu giladi wamnamate mzimbuli zake. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Avo, wawatuma wanahina zao hamoja na wanhu wa Helode,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wanhu wa Helode </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wanhu wakalile muutawala kulawa mmulango wa Helode Mkulu na mwanage yokemigwa Helode Antipa.</char></note> wolonga, “Mkulufunzi! Tuvitanga kamba gweye kwa munhu ulibule uzenzeleganye na kowafundiza wanhu ikweli ya gaja goyolonda Mulungu, bila kudumba gowogelegeza wanhu wayagwe, kwavija hulola ukulu wa munhu yoyose. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Tulongele, gweye kogesaze? Malagizo ga Musa gotogoza kuliha kodi ha Kaisali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kaisali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mndewa wa Loma.</char></note> ama gogomesa?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Ila Yesu kazitanga ngelegeza zao zihile, kalonga, “Videlenya mweye! Habali mgeza kunikila vitega? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Nilagusileni ihela ya kuliha kodi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Na hewo wamgalila ihela, <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>abaho, kawauza, “Kihanga kino na twaga dino va munhu yalihi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Wamwidika, “Va Kaisali.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Avo Yesu kawalongela, “Mulonga goya, avo ga Kaisali mgweleleni Kaisali, na ga Mulungu mgweleleni Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Viwahulike vino, wakanganya, avo wamuleka, wachola na zao.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Kuzuka Kulawa Mkudanganhika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk. 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk. 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Zua didija Masadukayo, awo wolonga kamba haduhu mzuso, wamcholela Yesu, wamuuza, <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>“Mkulufunzi! Musa katulongela kamba, kamba munhu yahadanganhika bila kuleka mwana, ndugu yake kolondigwa yamsole ija ikizuka giladi yamulelele mwana ndugu yake yadanganhike. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Avo kukala na ndugu saba mmwanza wetu, waichanduso kasola mtwanzi, abaho, kadanganhika bila kulela nayo mwana, abaho, ikizuka kamulekela ndugu yake. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Na ija waikabili gamulawilila gagaja, na waikadatu, na waja wose saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Hakimambukizo, na ija imtwanzi kadanganhika. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Avo mdizua da mzuso, imtwanzi ija kowa mtwanzi wa munhu yalihi? Kwavija wanhu wose saba wakala wamsolile.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yesu kawedika kawalongela, “Mweye muhonyela! Kwavija hamzitangile Zinyandiko Zing'alile ama mhiko za Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Kwavija mdizua da mzuso, wanhu hawasola ama kusoligwa, ila wolinga kamba wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Mmbuli ya mzuso wa wanhu wadanganhike, hamsomile Mzinyandiko Zing'alile kija kimulongeligwe na Mulungu? <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>‘Nie iyo Mulungu wa Ablaham, na Isaka, na Yakobo.’ Heyo iyo Mulungu wa wanhu wagima na sio Mulungu wa wanhu wadanganhike.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Didale da wanhu vidihulike gano, wakanganya mafundo gake.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagizi Ili Ng'hulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mlk. 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk. 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Ila Mafalisayo viwahulike kamba Yesu kawavudaliza Masadukayo, waiting'hana hamoja. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Na munhu imwe mmwanza wao, yakalile mfundiza Malagizo ga Musa, kamgeza mkumuuza, <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>“Mkulufunzi, ndagizi ilihi ili ng'hulu Mmalagizo ga Musa?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yesu kamwidika kamulongela, “ ‘Mnogele Mndewa Mulungu wako na moyo wako wose, na loho yako yose, na nzonzi zako zose.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Ino iyo ndagizi ili ng'hulu na iyo ya ichanduso. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Na ino iyo ndagizi ya ikabili, ‘Mnogele munhu wa habehi nagwe kamba vuukiinogela mwenyego.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Malagizo gose ga Musa na mafundo ga wahokozi gotamanila ndagizi zino mbili.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk. 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk. 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Mafalisayo viwaiting'hane hamoja, Yesu kawauza, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>“Mweye moigelegezaze mbuli ya Kilisto? Iyo mwana wa munhu yalihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Wamwidika wamulongela, “Iyo Mwana wa Daudi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Yesu kawauza, “Avo, vilihi Daudi kubitila mhiko za Loho wa Mulungu komkema Kilisto, ‘Mndewa’?<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>Kwavija kalonga, ‘Mndewa kamulongela Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">“Kala kumkono wangu wa ukulume</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">mbaka vondaniweke wadumuka zako hasi ya magulu gako.” ’<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Ihawa Daudi komkema Kilisto, ‘Mndewa,’ yodahikaze kuwa mwanage?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Haduhu munhu yadahile kumwidika mbuli yoyose, na kulawa zua dija haduhu munhu yagezile kumuuza mbuli yoyose.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowazuma Wanhu kamba Waiteganye na Vilangizi wa Dini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-39">Mat. 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk. 11:43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Abaho, Yesu kalonga na didale da wanhu na wanahina zake, <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>“Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wana udaho wa kugatapita Malagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Avo, gatendeni na kugagoga gaja gose gowowafundiza mweye, ila sambimtende vija vowotenda hewo, kwavija hewo hawagatenda gaja gowofundiza. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Wowafungila wanhu mibahasha mikulu na kuwadikwa mmaega, ila hewo wenyego hawalonda hata kugolosa kidole waipape. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Wotenda mbuli zao zose giladi woneke na wanhu. Avo, wofudika mifundo mikulu mgati yandikigwe Nyandiko za Malagizo ga Musa uchana mwa ikihanga na mmakono! Na wokwika minyemvule mitali ng'hani mmikanzu yao! <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Wonogelwa kukala m'vigoda va haulongozi mulusona na kukala m'vigoda va haulongozi mzing'anda za nhambiko, <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>na kulamsigwa na hishima mmasoko na kukemigwa, ‘Mkulufunzi.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Ila mweye sambimkemigwe ‘Mkulufunzi,’ kwavija muna mkulufunzi imwe, na mweye mose mwa kinhu kimwe kamba ndugu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Na sambimumkeme munhu yoyose ‘tata’ muisi, kwavija Tataenu iyo imwe yali kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Ama sambimkemigwe ‘Vilangizi,’ kwavija muna kilangizi imwe, iyo Kilisto. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Yali mkulu mmwanza wenu yawe mtumigwa wenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Ila yoyose yokiinula kohumuluswa, na yoyose yokiihumulusa kokwinuligwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Koutagusa Udelenya Wao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mlk. 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luk. 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>“Mojona, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mweye videlenya! Moluhinda lwivi lwa Undewa wa Kuulanga haulongozi wa wanhu, na mweye wenyego hamwingila ama hamuwatogoza kwingila waja wolonda kwingila! <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>Mojona, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mweye videlenya! Mowabulunya vizuka na kutenda nhambiko nhali za uzenzeleganye. Avo nhaguso yenu yowa ng'hulu ng'hani!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zabule mnhongo wa 14.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>“Mojona, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, videlenya! Mofunga mwanza kuchola muisi inyalile na m'bahali giladi kumzahila munhu imwe yawinze nhamanila yenu. Na muhampata, momtenda yawe mwana wa kuzimu mianza mibili kubanza mweye wenyego.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>“Mojona, vilangizi vimbugumbugu! Mweye mulonga, ‘Ihawa munhu yahaiduilila Ng'anda ya Mulungu, jaga bule. Ila munhu yahaiduilila zahabu ya muna Ing'anda ya Mulungu, kakiifunga na ikiduilo chake.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Mweye vimbugumbugu wabozi! Kilihi kili kikulu, izahabu ama Ing'anda ya Mulungu iitenda izahabu ing'ale? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Vivija mulonga, ‘Ihawa munhu yahaiduilila kilingo cha kulavila nhosa, jaga bule. Ila munhu yahaiduilila nhunza ili hachana ya ikilingo hicho, kakiifunga na ikiduilo chake.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Mweye vimbugumbugu! Kilihi kili kikulu, inhunza ama ikilingo cha kulavila nhosa kiitenda inhunza ing'ale? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Avo, heyo yoiduilila ikilingo cha kulavila nhosa, kaiduilila ikilingo hicho hamoja na kila kinhu kili hachana yake. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Na heyo yoiduilila Ng'anda ya Mulungu, kaiduilila Ing'anda hiyo hamoja na Mulungu yokala himo. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Na heyo yoiduilila ulanga, kakiiduilila kigoda cha undewa cha Mulungu hamoja na ija yakikalile.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>“Mojona, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, videlenya! Kwavija molava zaka za vinhu va kulungila mandia na mboga kamba vija matepo ga kunung'hila, binzali, na jila. Ila muleka mafundo makulu ga Malagizo ga Musa, kamba vija bazi, nhamanila, na kuwa bule uzenzeleganye. Gano gago mulondigwa kutenda, na bila kuleka gaja gayagwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Mweye vilangizi vimbugumbugu! Molenguza nzuguni, ila momeza ngamia! <figure style="fig" alt="camel with a man" file="lb00039c.jpg" size="col" loc="Mat 23:24" copy="Louise Bass © The British and Foreign Bible Society 1994." ref="23:24">Ngamia</figure><verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>“Mojona, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, videlenya! Mweye mwa kamba munhu yosuluza hanze ya kikasi na sahani, ila mgati vimema vinhu m'vipatile muubavi na ugila. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Gweye Mfalisayo kimbugumbugu! Tanhu suluza mgati mwa ikikasi, abaho, vivija na hanze chong'ala!<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>“Mojona, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, videlenya! Kwavija mulinga na mapanga gabakazigwe chokaa, hanze gokoneka mazelu ila mgati gamema mizege na vinhu vose vihile. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Vivo na mweye, kunze mokoneka na wanhu kamba mnoga, ila mgati mmema udelenya na mbuli zihile.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kohokola Nhaguso Yao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luk. 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>“Mojona, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, videlenya! Mozenga mapanga ga wahokozi na kugahamba mapanga ga wanhu wanogile. <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>Abaho, molonga, ‘Kamba tuhawile baho mkipigiti hicho cha wahenga zetu, sambituilumbe nao mkuwakoma wahokozi.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Avo, mweye wenyego mosindila kamba mweye mwa lukolo lwa wanhu waja wawakomile wahokozi! <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Avo, mambukizileni gaja gawasongile wahenga zenu! <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Mweye nyoka, wana wa nyoka! Moikimbila vilihi nhaguso ya kuzimu? <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Avo, nowalagizila wahokozi, wanhu wali na nzewele, na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Ila wayagwe mowakoma na kuwawamba mumsalaba, na wayagwe mowalanha mbalati mzing'anda zenu za nhambiko na kuwawinga kulawa kiwambo kimwe mbaka kiwambo kiyagwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Nhaguso ya mulopa wa wanhu wose watendile ganogile muisi iwapate mweye, kulawa mulopa wa Abeli mbaka mulopa wa Zakalia, mwanage Balakia, mumkomile hagatigati ya Ing'anda ya Mulungu na ikilingo cha kulavila nhosa. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Nowalongela ikweli, nhaguso ya wakomaji wano wose yowapata wanhu wa mulelo uno!<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Noge da Yesu Sama ya Wambo da Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk. 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>“Yelusalemu, Yelusalemu! Gweye uwakoma wahokozi na kuwatoa na mabwe waja watumigwe kumwako! Mianza mingahi nilonda kuwakunzanya hamoja wanago kamba nguku viyowafagatila wanage hasi ya mbawa zake, ila hutogole! <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Na ng'anda yako yolekigwa na yowa ukiwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Nokulongela, hunyona nie kabili mbaka vondaulonge, ‘Kamota ayo yokwiza mditwaga da Mndewa.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kolongelela Ubananzi wa Ng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk. 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk. 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Yesu kalawa Kung'anda ya Mulungu, na viyakalile yochola wanahina zake wamcholela giladi wamulagusile ng'anda zizunguluke Ing'anda ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Yesu kalonga, “Mozona ng'anda zino zose? Nowalongela ikweli, haduhu hata dibwe dimwe dondadisigale uchana ya diyagwe, dondadileke kubomoligwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kugaya na Kugazigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk. 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk. 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Yesu viyakalile yakalile Hakigongo cha Mizaituni, wanahina wamcholela weiyeka, wamulongela, “Tulongele, zua jaki vondagalawilile gano, na choni chondakiwe kilaguso cha wizilo wako na idizua da kimambukizo?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Teganyeni, munhu sambiyawagize. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Kwavija wanhu bwando wokwiza mtwaga jangu, wolonga, ‘Nie iyo Kilisto!’ Na wowagiza wanhu bwando. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Mohulika ng'hondo na singilimo za ng'hondo, ila sambimdumbe. Kwavija vinhu kamba vino volondigwa vilawilile, ila ikimambukizo hakinavika. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Isi yogomba na isi iyagwe, na undewa wouvamhila undewa uyagwe. Yolawila nzala na mgudemo wa isi kila hanhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Gano gose gowa kamba mwanduso wa usungu wa kulela mwana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>“Abaho, mogogigwa giladi mgazigwe na kukomigwa. Na wanhu wose wa isi zose wowehila sama yangu nie. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Kipigiti kija wanhu bwando woileka nhamanila yao, na kukiihonza na kukiihila wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Abaho, wahokozi bwando wa uvwizi wolawilila, na kuwagiza wanhu bwando. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Sama ya kongezeka mbuli zihile, noge da wanhu bwando dohuha. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Ila yondayananahile mbaka hakimambukizo, iyo yondayakomboligwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Na Usenga uno Unogile wa Undewa wa Mulungu wopetigwa kila hanhu muulumwengu wose giladi uwe usindila ha wanhu wa isi zose, abaho, ikimambukizo cha isi leka kize.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinhu Kinyolodoke Kigala Ubananzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mlk. 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk. 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>Munhu yondayasome yaitange nhegulo yake! Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Muhachona ‘Kinhu Kinyolodoke Kigala Ubananzi’ kilongigwe na muhokozi Danieli kima Hanhu Hang'alile Ng'hani Muing'anda ya Mulungu, <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>avo, awo wali Yudea wakimbilile m'vigongo. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Munhu yoyose yali mkiswili cha ng'anda yake sambiyahumuluke hasi na kusola kinhu chochose kulawa mng'anda yake. <figure style="fig" alt="People on roof of house" file="LB00234B.jpg" size="col" loc="Mat 24:17" copy="Louise Bass © The British and Foreign Bible Society 1994." ref="24:17">Mkiswili cha Ng'anda</figure> <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Munhu yoyose yali kumgunda sambiyabwele kusola kivalo chake. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Wojona watwanzi wali na inda na watwanzi wali na ving'hele mmazua higo! <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Tambikeni giladi ng'himbila yenu sambiiwe mkipigiti cha kihuhe ama mkipigiti cha Zua da Mhumulo! <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Kwavija wowa mgayo mkulu, haunapata kulawilila songela kulumbigwa kwa ulumwengu mbaka sambi, na haulawila kabili mgayo kamba hiwo. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Na kamba kipigiti kija sambikihunguzwe na Mulungu, haduhu munhu yahadahile kukombolwa, ila sama ya wanhu wasaguligwe na Mulungu, kipigiti hicho kihunguzwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>“Abaho, kamba munhu yoyose yahawalongela, ‘Lola! Kilisto kahano,’ ama ‘Kahaja!’ Sambimtogole. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Kwavija makilisto wa uvwizi na wahokozi wa uvwizi wolawila, wotenda vilaguso na mizonza mikulu giladi kamba vihadahika wawagize hata wanhu wasaguligwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Tegelezeni! Niwalongela nisha mbuli zino kipigiti king'hali hakinavika.<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>“Avo kamba wanhu wahawalongela, ‘Kamkiwala!’ Sambimchole, ama wahalonga, ‘Kakugati!’ Sambimtogole. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Kwavija kamba lumwemwe vulumwemwesa kulawa haulawilo wa zua na koneka mbaka kuuswelo wa zua, na Mwana wa Munhu vivo vondayoneke kipigiti vondayeze.<verse eid="MAT 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>“Hohose hali na mtufi baho hondawaiting'hane vimhungu.<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwiza kwa Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk. 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk. 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>“Bahaja ikipigiti cha mazua ga mgayo vondakimale, zua doziziwala, mulenge haulava mulangaza wake, nhondo zolagala kulawa kuulanga, na mhiko za kuulanga zokwekwesigwa kulawa hazikalile. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Abaho, kilaguso cha Mwana wa Munhu chokoneka kuulanga, na wanhu wa isi zose wolila ahaja vondawanyone nie Mwana wa Munhu nikwiza muna gamawingu ga kuulanga na mhiko na yenzi ng'hulu. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Kowalagiza wasenga zake wa kuulanga wali na mhalati ilava dizwi kulu, na wowakunzanya wanhu zake wasaguligwe na Mulungu kulawa ng'ambu zose za ulumwengu.<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk. 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk. 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>“Muifundize mum'biki wa mtini. Matambi gake gahasonga udeke wa kuzuka na kulava matepo, movitanga kamba vuli da mmabehi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Vivija na mweye, muhazona mbuli zino zose, m'vitange kamba ka mmabehi kwiza. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Nowalongela ikweli, wanhu wa mulelo uno hawadanganhika mbaka mbuli zino zose zilawilile. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Ulanga na isi vose vobita, ila mbuli zangu hazibita.<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Haduhu Munhu Yoditanga Zua ama Saa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mlk. 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk. 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>“Haduhu munhu yoditanga zua ama saa, si wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, ama Mwana, ila Tata yeiyeka. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Kwiza kwa Mwana wa Munhu kowa kamba mkipigiti cha Nuhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Kwavija mmemelo wa mazi vuukalile haunalawila, wanhu wakala woja na kung'wa, wasola na kusoligwa, mbaka zua dija Nuhu viyengile muisafina, <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>hawakitangile kija kilondile kulawilila, mbaka mmemelo wa mazi vuwizile na kuwakoma wanhu wose. Na vino vivo vondayeze Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Mkipigiti hicho, wambigalo wabili wolima mumgunda, imwe kosoligwa na iyagwe kolekigwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Watwanzi wabili wotwanga, imwe kosoligwa na iyagwe kolekigwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>“Avo goneleleni, kwavija hamuditanga zua dondayeze Mndewa wenu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Ila m'vitange kamba, kamba mwene ng'anda yahakitangile kipigiti chondayeze m'bavi, yahagonelele na sambiyaileke ng'anda yake ibomoligwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Avo, na mweye muisasale, kwavija Mwana wa Munhu kokwiza mkipigiti hamkitangile.<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mtumigwa Mwende na Mtumigwa Yalibule Wende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk. 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>“Yalihi mtumigwa mwende na m'bala, mndewa wake yamtendile salange wa watumigwa wali mng'anda yake yondayawagwelele mandia gao mkipigiti kilondigwa? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Kamota mtumigwa ija mndewa wake yahabwela yom'vika yotenda vino! <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Nowalongela ikweli, komtenda yawe mkulu wa vinhu vake vose. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Ila kamba ija imtumigwa yehile koilongela mwenyego, ‘Mndewa wangu kokawa kubwela,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>na kusonga kuwatoa watumigwa wayage na kuja na kung'wa na wang'wa ugimbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>Abaho, mndewa wa imtumigwa ija kokwiza mdizua yalekile kudigelegeza na saa yalekile kuitanga. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>Abaho, komkanha vidangavidanga imtumigwa ija na kumwika mdidale dimwe na videlenya. Ako kowa na kililo na kugegedula meno.<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Wandele Longo Dimwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>“Kipigiti kija Undewa wa Kuulanga wolinga na wandele longo dimwe wasolile viwenge vao na kuchola kum'bokela mulawilamhambe. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Wandele watano wakala wabozi na watano wakala wabala. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Waja iwabozi wasola viwenge vao, bila kugela mavuta mgati yake. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Ila waja iwabala wasola viwenge vao hamoja na via va mavuta. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Kwavija mulawilamhambe kakawa kwiza, wose wakukila na kuwasa.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>“Kilo kikulu kukala na nyangi, ‘Mulawilamhambe kavika! Laweni mkam'bokele!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Abaho, waja iwandele wose walamuka na kuvigongomanya viwenge vao. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Abaho, waja iwabozi wawalongela waja iwabala, ‘Tugweleleni mavuta genu, kwavija viwenge vetu vofa.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Waja iwabala wawalongela, ‘Hagatutosha tweye na mweye. Ila gendeni ha wachuluzi mkagule.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Viwakalile mnzila wochola kugula mavuta, mulawilamhambe kavika. Na waja watano wakalile waisasale wengila hamoja nayo mulusona lwa zengele, abaho, lwivi luhindigwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>“Kipigiti waja iwandele wabozi viwezile, wakemelela, walonga, ‘Mndewa, Mndewa! Tuvugulile!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>Mulawilamhambe kawalongela, ‘Nowalongela ikweli! Siwatanga mweye.’<verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>“Avo, goneleleni, kwavija hamditanga zua ama saa yondanibweleganye.<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Watumigwa Wadatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk. 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>“Kipigiti kija Undewa wa Kuulanga wolinga na munhu yochola mwanza, kawakema watumigwa zake na kuwatenda wemilizi wa vinhu vake. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Kila munhu kagweleligwa kulingana na vija viyadahile, imwe kagweleligwa talanta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Talanta imwe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hela ya kitumetume cha milao 15.</char></note> tano na iyagwe talanta mbili na iyagwe talanta imwe. Abaho, ija imunhu kachola mwanza wake. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Ija imtumigwa yagweleligwe talanta tano, baho kachola kuzitendela uchuluzi talanta zake, na kapata talanta tano ziyagwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Vivija na ija yagweleligwe talanta mbili, kapata talanta mbili ziyagwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Ila ija imtumigwa yagweleligwe talanta imwe, kachola kuhimba lwingila, abaho, kaifisa italanta ya mndewa wake.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>“Vikibitile kipigiti kitali, ija imndewa wa waja iwatumigwa kabwela na kutenda mheta ya talanta zao. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Ija imtumigwa yagweleligwe talanta tano, kagala talanta tano ziyagwe, kalonga, ‘Mndewa, kunigwela talanta tano, hano hana talanta tano ziyagwe zinipatile!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Mndewa wake kamulongela, ‘Kutenda goya mtumigwa unogile na ulibule uzenzeleganye! Na kwavija hutendile uzenzeleganye m'vinhu vidodo, avo nokutenda uwe mwimilizi wa vinhu bwando. Izo udeng'he hamoja na nie, mndewa wako!’<verse eid="MAT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>“Vivija na ija imtumigwa yagweleligwe talanta mbili keza kalonga, ‘Mndewa, kunigwelela talanta mbili, hano hana talanta mbili ziyagwe zinipatile.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Mndewa wake kamulongela, ‘Kutenda goya mtumigwa unogile na ulibule uzenzeleganye! Na kwavija hutendile uzenzeleganye m'vinhu vidodo, avo nokutenda uwe mwimilizi wa vinhu bwando. Izo udeng'he hamoja na nie, mndewa wako!’<verse eid="MAT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>“Abaho, ija imtumigwa yagweleligwe talanta imwe keza kalonga, ‘Mndewa, nivitanga kamba gweye kwa munhu mdala, kohuna vija huvihandile, na kokunzanya haja haulekile kumiza mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Avo nidumba, nichola kuifisa talanta yako hasi muisi. Avo talanta yako ino hano.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>“Mndewa wake kamulongela, ‘Gweye mtumigwa mwavu na mkoka! Kuvitanga kamba nie nohuna vija sivihandile na nokunzanya haja hanilekile kumiza? <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Kulondigwa talanta yangu ukaike benki, vinibwelile nihaivikile talanta yangu na kija chongezeke. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Avo, m'bokeni italanta, abaho, mumgwelele ija imtumigwa yali na talanta longo dimwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Kwavija munhu yali na kinhu kokongezelwa, na kowa navo bwando. Ila munhu yalibule kinhu, hata kija ikidodo chayalinacho kobokigwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Ino mtumigwa mwavu, mwaseni hanze hana diziza. Ako kowa na kililo na kugegedula meno.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhaguso ya Kimambukizo cha Ulumwengu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>“Mwana wa Munhu vondayeze muna iyenzi yake, hamoja na wasenga wose wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, kokala mkigoda chake cha undewa. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Na wanhu wa isi zose woilundiza haulongozi wake. Abaho, kowabagula kamba mchunga voyowabagula ng'hondolo na menhe. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Ng'hondolo koweka ng'ambu yake ya ukulume, na menhe ng'ambu yake ya ukumoso. <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Abaho, Mndewa kowalongela waja wali ng'ambu yake ya ukulume, ‘Izoni, mweye mmotezwe na Tataangu! Muuhale Undewa mtandiligwe songela vuulumbigwe ulumwengu. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Kwavija nikala na nzala munigwelela mandia, nikala na ng'hilu muning'weza, nikala muhenza munibokela, <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>nikala bule vivalo munivaza, nikala mtamu mwiza kunyuguza, na nikala mkifungo mwiza kunitembelela.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>“Abaho, waja wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye womwidika, ‘Mndewa, zua jaki vitukuwene kukala na nzala tukugwelela mandia, ama kukala na ng'hilu tukung'weza? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Zua jaki vitukuwene kukala muhenza tukubokela, ama kukala kwabule vivalo tukuvaza? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Zua jaki vitukuwene kukala mtamu ama kukala mkifungo, twiza kukutembelela?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Abaho, Mndewa kowalongela, ‘Nowalongela ikweli, kinhu chochose kimumtendele munhu imwe wa wano ndugu zangu wadodo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:40 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ndugu zangu wadodo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wakumbulu. </char></note> munitendela nie!’<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>“Abaho, kowalongela waja wanhu wali ng'ambu yake ya ukumoso, ‘Segeleni hamwangu, mweye mdukumizwe na Mulungu! Gendeni hana umoto wa digunge yekiligwe Mwenembago na vinyamkela zake! <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Kwavija nikala na nzala hamunigwelele mandia, na nikala na ng'hilu hamuning'weze, <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>nikala muhenza hamunibokele, nikala bule vivalo hamunivazile, nikala mtamu na nikala mkifungo hamwizile kunitembelela.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>“Vivija na hewo womwidika, ‘Mndewa, zua jaki vitukuwene kukala na nzala, ama kukala na ng'hilu, ama kukala muhenza, ama kukala bule vivalo, ama kukala mtamu, ama kukala mkifungo, na tweye hatukutazile?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Abaho, Mndewa kowalongela, ‘Nowalongela ikweli, vumulekile kumtendela mbuli zino imwe wa wano ndugu zangu wadodo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:45 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ndugu zangu wadodo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wakumbulu.</char></note> hamunitendele nie.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Avo wanhu wano wokwingila muinhaguso ya digunge, ila waja walibule uzenzeleganye wokwingila muugima wa digunge.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Zundo da Kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk. 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Yesu viyamambukize kufundiza mbuli zino zose, kawalongela wanahina zake, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>“Movitanga kamba gahabita mazua mabili lowa Lusona lwa Pasaka, na Mwana wa Munhu kogogigwa giladi yawambigwe mumsalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Abaho, wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wavyele wa wanhu waiting'hana mding'anda da kindewa da Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko, yokemigwa Kayafa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Weka zundo mkuzahila nzila ya uzenzeleganye ya kumgoga Yesu giladi wamkome. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Walonga, “Sambitutende mbuli ino mkipigiti cha lusona giladi sambikilawilile kiyahiyahi mwa wanhu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kobakigwa Mavuta ako Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mlk. 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoh. 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Yesu kakala Betania kung'anda ya Simoni ayo yakalile na utamu wa dikulu. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Kipigiti Yesu viyakalile yoja hana imeza, keza mtwanzi imwe, yakalile na nyhupa ya alabasta ili na mavuta ga kunung'hila ga hela bwando, kamcholela Yesu kamwitila mpala jake. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Wanahina viwawene gano, wona lusango, walonga, “Ubananzi uno wa choni? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Mavuta gano gahaguzigwe na hela bwando, abaho, zihela wahagweleligwe wakumbulu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Ila Yesu viyazitangile ngelegeza zao, kawalongela, “Habali mumgaza mtwanzi ino? Kanhendela kinhu kinogile ng'hani. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Wakumbulu mokala nao mazua gose, ila nie sikala na mweye mazua gose. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Viyanitile mavuta gano mulukuli lwangu, kanisasala na mazisi. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Nowalongela ikweli, hanhu hohose hondaupetigwe Usenga uno Unogile muulumwengu wose, kija chayatendile mtwanzi ino cholongwa mkumkumbukila heyo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Kotogola Kumuhonza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk. 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk. 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Abaho, imwe wa wanahina longo dimwe na wabili, yakemigwe Yuda Isikalioti, kachola ha wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>kawauza, “Monigwelela choni kamba nihamgela Yesu mmakono genu?” Avo wamgwelela vidanga malongo madatu va hela. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Kulawa haja Yuda kasonga kuzahila nzila ya kumgela mmakono gao.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Koja Mandia ga Pasaka na Wanahina Zake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk. 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luk. 22:7-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Muna dizua da mwanduso wa Lusona lwa Mikate Ilibule Mela, wanahina wamcholela Yesu wamuuza, “Kwahi kuulonda tukakutandile mandia ga Pasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Gendeni mdiwambo, mom'vika munhu, abaho, mulongeleni, ‘Mkulufunzi kolonga, “Kipigiti kiyakisagule Mulungu sama yangu nie kikwenhuka. Nie na wanahina zangu toja mandia ga Pasaka mng'anda yako.” ’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Wanahina watenda kamba Yesu viyawalagize, abaho, wagatanda mandia ga Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Viivikile ichungulo, Yesu kakala hana imeza hamoja na wanahina zake longo dimwe na wabili. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Viwakalile woja, Yesu kalonga, “Nowalongela ikweli, imwe mmwanza wenu konihonza.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Wanahina wona giogio, na wasonga kumuuza imweimwe, “Nie, Mndewa?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ayo yozanhika mkate mkia hamoja na nie iyo yondayanihonze. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Mwana wa Munhu kodanganhika kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzimulonga. Ila kojona munhu ija yondayamuhonze Mwana wa Munhu! Vihanogile munhu hiyo sambiyaleligwe!”<verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Yuda, yakalile yolonda kumuhonza, kamuuza, “Nie, Mkulufunzi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu kamwidika, “Gweye kulonga vino.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandia ga Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk. 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk. 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kol. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Viwakalile woja, Yesu kasola mkate, kaumoteza, abaho, kaumogola, kawagwelela wanahina zake, kalonga, “Soleni mje, kwavija uno uwo lukuli lwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Abaho kasola kikasi, kalonga hewela, kawagwelela wanahina zake, kalonga, “Ing'weni, mose, <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>kwavija uno uwo mulopa wangu uli usindila wa lagano da Mulungu na wanhu zake, witike sama ya wanhu bwando giladi wageligwe kumgongo vilozo vao. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Nowalongela, sing'wa kabili mulelo uno wa zabibu mbaka zua dija vondaniung'we wa sambi hamoja na mweye Muundewa wa Tataangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Viweshile kwimba, wachola hana Ikigongo cha Mizaituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kohokola Kamba Petulo Kom'bela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk. 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela, “Kilo ya lelo, mweye mose mong'himbila, kamba viyandikigwe Mnyandiko Zing'alile, ‘Nomtoa imchunga, na didale da ng'hondolo dopwililika.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Ila nihazuka, nowalongola kuchola Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Petulo kalonga, “Hata kamba wose wahakukimbila, nie sikukimbila bule!”<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesu kamulongela Petulo, “Nokulongela ikweli, kilo ya lelo, nzogolo yang'hali hanakwika, konibela mianza midatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Petulo kamulongela, “Hata kamba kudanganhika, nidanganhike hamoja na gweye! Sikubela bule!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Na wanahina wose wasigale walonga vivo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kotambika ako Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk. 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk. 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Abaho, Yesu kachola hamoja na wanahina zake hanhu hakemigwe Getisemane, kawalongela, “Kaleni hano, nie nichole haja kutambika.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Kawasola Petulo na waja iwana wabili wa Zebedayo, kasonga kona giogio na kugazika. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Abaho, kawalongela, “Moyo wangu una giogio ng'hani behi na kudanganhika. Kaleni hano mgonelele hamoja na nie.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Kachola hamwande kidogo, katambalala kingubanguba, katambika, yolonga, “Tataangu, vihadahika, kikasi kino cha migayo kinisegele! Ila sio kamba vinilonda nie, ila kamba vuulonda gweye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Abaho, kawabwelela waja iwanahina, kawavika wawasa. Kamuuza Petulo, “Mulemelwa kugonelela hamoja na nie hata saa dimwe? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Goneleleni, mtambike, giladi sambimwingile mkugezigwa. Kwavija loho yolonda, ila lukuli lutepweta.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Yesu kachola mwanza wa ikabili, katambika, yolonga, “Tataangu, kamba havidahika kikasi kino cha migayo kinisegele ila mbaka niking'wele, gaja guulonda gatendeke.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Viyabweleganye mwanza uyagwe, kawavika wawasa, kwavija meso gao gakala na utulo.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Avo kawaleka, kachola kutambika mwanza wa ikadatu, yolonga mbuli zizija. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Abaho, kawabwelela wanahina kawalongela, “Mng'hali wasa na kuhumula? Saa ivika ya Mwana wa Munhu kugeligwa mmakono ga wanhu wene vilozo. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Lamukeni, tuchole! Loleni, munhu yonihonza ka habehi!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk. 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoh. 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yolonga, Yuda, imwe wa iwanahina longo dimwe na wabili, keza. Kailongoza hamoja na dale kulu da wanhu wapapile mizele na mimbwego. Wakala watumigwe na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wavyele wa wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Imunhu yomuhonza kawagwelela utango, kawalongela, “Ija yondanimnonele, iyo heyo. Mgogeni!”<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Baho Yuda kamcholela Yesu, kalonga, “Nokulamsa, Mkulufunzi!” Abaho, kamnonela.<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Mbwiga, tenda chuuwinzile!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Abaho, waja iwanhu weza, wamgoga Yesu na kumfunga. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Imwe wa waja wakalile na Yesu kasomola zele jake na kumkanha gwiti nyakadala wa Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Bweza zele jako muna iyala yake, kwavija wose wotamanila zele wodanganhika na zele. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Mokwagiza kamba sidaha kumulongela Tataangu yanigalile sambisambi madale gabanza longo dimwe na mabili ga wasenga zake wa kuulanga? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Ila zovikila vilihi Nyandiko Zing'alile zilonga kamba vino vivo vilondigwa ilawilile?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Kipigiti kikija Yesu kadilongela didale da wanhu, “Mwiza na mizele na mimbwego kunigoga kamba nie na m'bokonyi? Mazua gose nikala nifundiza kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu, na mweye hamunigogile. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Ila gano gose galawilila, giladi Nyandiko Zing'alile za wahokozi zivikile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Abaho, wanahina wose wamuleka, wakimbila.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kogaligwa hana Ikitala Kikulu cha Isi ya Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mlk. 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk. 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoh. 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Waja wamgogile Yesu wamsola wamgala ha Kayafa, Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko, kuwaiting'hane wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na wavyele wa wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Petulo kamkoleleza kutalitali mbaka kudikonhi da ing'anda ya Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko. Kengila na kukala hasi hamoja na wemilizi giladi yachone chondakilawilile. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko hamoja na Ikitala chose Kikulu cha Isi ya Wayahudi wazahila usindila wa uvwizi giladi wamkome Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Walawilila wasindila bwando wa uvwizi, ila hawapatile mbuli yoyose. Hakimambukizo, walawilila wanhu wabili <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>walonga, “Munhu ino kalonga, ‘Nie nodaha kuibomola Ng'anda ya Mulungu na kuizenga mmazua madatu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko kenuka kamulongela Yesu, “Kwabule kinhu cha kwidika? Usindila waki uno woolava wanhu wano wokutagusa gweye?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Ila Yesu kanyamala. Abaho Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko kamuuza, “Nokuduiza ha Mulungu yali mgima, tulongele kamba gweye iyo Kilisto, Mwana wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yesu kamwidika kalonga, “Gweye kulonga vino. Ila nowalongela, kulawa kipigiti kino monyona nie Mwana wa Munhu nikalile ng'ambu ya ukulume ya Ukulu, nikwiza muna gamawingu ga kuulanga!”<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Abaho, Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko kadega vivalo vake kalonga, “Kafukula! Habali tulonda wasindila wayagwe? Avo muhulika ufukuzi wake! <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Mogelegeza vilihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Wamwidika, “Kolondigwa yakomigwe!”<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Abaho, wamtemela mate mkihanga chake, wamtoa, na wayagwe wamtoa makofi, <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>walonga, “Gweye Kilisto, zuza! Yalihi yakutoile?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petulo Kom'bela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mlk. 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk. 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh. 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Petulo viyakalile yakalile hasi hanze ya idikonhi, mtumigwa imwe wa kitwanzi wa Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko kamcholela kamulongela, “Na gweye kwa hamwe na Yesu wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Ila Petulo kabela haulongozi wa wanhu wose, kamulongela, “Sikitanga chuulonga.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Viyakalile yolawa hanze ya idikonhi, mtumigwa iyagwe wa kitwanzi kamona na kuwalongela wanhu wakalile haja, “Munhu ino kakala hamwe na Yesu wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Petulo kabela mwanza uyagwe mkuiduila, kalonga, “Simtanga munhu ino!”<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Kipigiti kidodo hamwande, wanhu wemile haja wamcholela Petulo wamulongela, “Tokona na gweye kwa mmwanza wao, kwavija hata ulonzi wako ulinga na hewo!”<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Abaho, Petulo kasonga kuidukumiza na kuiduila, yolonga, “Simtanga munhu ija!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Kipigiti kikija nzogolo keka. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Petulo kakumbukila vija Yesu viyamulongele, “Nzogolo yang'hali hanakwika, konibela mianza midatu.” Kalawa hanze kalila ng'hani.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kogaligwa ha Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mlk. 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk. 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yoh. 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Imitondo ng'hani, wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko wose na wavyele wa wanhu wamwikila zundo Yesu giladi wazahile nzila ya kumkoma. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Wamfunga, wamsola, na kumgala ha Pilato, mndewa wa Yudea kulawa Loma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Kodanganhika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Sang'h. 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Abaho, Yuda, ija yamuhonzile Yesu, viyawene kamba Yesu katagusigwa kudanganhika, kona giogio na kuvibweza vija vidanga malongo madatu va hela ha wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wavyele wa wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>Kalonga, “Nitenda vilozo mkumuhonza munhu yakalile bule mbuli yoyose ihile!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Na hewo wamulongela, “Avo tweye tutendeze? Na lwako mwenyego!”<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Avo Yuda kazibwanha zihela muna Ing'anda ya Mulungu, abaho, kalawa hanze ya idikonhi da Ing'anda ya Mulungu, kachola kuibota.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko wazidondola zihela, walonga, “Hela zino za mulopa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:6 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Hela za mulopa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hela za kitumetume cha kumkoma munhu.</char></note> zigomesigwa na Malagizo ga Musa kwikigwa muna ingama ya Ng'anda ya Mulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Avo, walamula kamba hela zija wagule mgunda wa munhu imwe yakalile muumbi giladi hawe hanhu ha kuzikila wahenza. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Avo mbaka lelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:8 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka lelo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti Matayo viyandike kitabu kino.</char></note> mgunda uja wokemigwa, “Mgunda wa Mulopa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Abaho, gavikila gaja galongigwe na muhokozi Yelemia, “Wasola vidanga malongo madatu va hela, kiasi kikigwe na wanhu wa Islaeli sama yake, <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>na zihela wazigulila mgunda wa munhu imwe yakalile muumbi, kamba Mndewa viyanilagize.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilato Komuuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mlk. 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk. 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yoh. 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Yesu kema haulongozi wa Pilato, mndewa wa Yudea kulawa Loma, na Pilato kamuuza, “Gweye iyo mndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu kamulongela, “Gweye iyo ulonga avo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Ila wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wavyele wa wanhu viwakalile womtagusa, halongile kinhu chochose.<verse eid="MAT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Abaho, Pilato kamuuza, “Huhulika mbuli bwando zowokutagusa?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Ila Yesu hedike hata mbuli imwe, avo Pilato kakanganya ng'hani.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kotagusigwa Kudanganhika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk. 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk. 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoh. 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Mkipigiti cha Lusona lwa Pasaka, mndewa wa Yudea kulawa Loma kakala na nzoela ya kumfungulila mfungigwa imwe ija wanhu iwamulondile. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Kipigiti kija kukala na mfungigwa imwe yatangigwe ng'hani na wanhu sama ya kutenda gehile yokemigwa Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Avo, dale da wanhu vidiiting'hane, Pilato kawauza, “Yalihi yummulonda niwafungulile? Balaba, ama Yesu yokemigwa Kilisto?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Kwavija Pilato kavitanga kamba wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wavyele wa wanhu wamgala Yesu kumwake sama ya migongo.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Pilato viyakalile mkigoda cha nhaguso, mtwanzi wake kamtumila usenga, kamulongela, “Sambiumtende kinhu chochose munhu hiyo yalibule vilozo, kwavija lelo nigaya ng'hani mnzozi sama yake.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Ila wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wavyele wa wanhu wadiswagiza didale da wanhu dimpule Pilato yawafungulile Balaba na Yesu yakomigwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Pilato kadiuza didale da wanhu, “Yalihi mwa wanhu wano wabili yummulonda niwafungulile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Wamwidika, “Balaba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilato kawauza, “Nimtendeze Yesu yokemigwa Kilisto?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Wose wamwidika, “Yawambigwe mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Pilato kawauza, “Habali, mbuli yaki ihile yaatendile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Ila wose wongeza kuguta nyangi wolonga, “Yawambigwe mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Pilato viyawene kamba hawamtegeleza, ila kizuka kiyahiyahi, kasola mazi na kusuluza makono gake haulongozi wa didale da wanhu, kalonga, “Nie nabule mbuli na ifa ya munhu ino! Iloleni mwemwe wenyego!”<verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Didale da wanhu dimulongela, “Nhaguso ya ifa yake toisola tweye na wanetu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Abaho, Pilato kawafungulila Balaba, na kuwalagiza asikali wamulanhe Yesu mbalati, na kumgela mmakono gao giladi yawambigwe mumsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asikali Womtendela Yesu Uponela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mlk. 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoh. 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Abaho, asikali wa mndewa wa Yudea kulawa Loma wamsola Yesu wamwingiza mding'anda da ija imndewa, abaho, dale jose da asikali dimzunguluka. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Wam'vula vivalo vake na kum'vaza kanzu da zambalau. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Abaho, waluka mkungo wa mizomola wamwikila mpala jake na kumwikila ludete mumkono wake wa ukulume. Abaho, wamfugamila mavindi na kumtendela uponela, wamulongela, “Kwa mpile, Mndewa wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Wamtemela mate, wasola ludete na kumulanha nao mpala. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Viwamambukize kumtendela uponela, wam'vula dija dikanzu, wam'vaza vivalo vake. Abaho, wamgala kumuwamba mumsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowambigwa Mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk. 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Viwakalile wochola, waiting'hana na munhu kulawa isi ya Kilene, yakemigwe Simoni, wemilizi wamshulutiza giladi yaupape msalaba wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Wavika hanhu hakemigwe, Goligota, nhegulo yake “Hanhu ha Fulu da Pala.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Wamgwelela Yesu divai igeligwe vinhu va usungu, ila viyailanzile, haing'wile.<verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Wamuwamba mumsalaba, abaho, wakiigolela vivalo vake mkuvitoela kula. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Abaho, wakala hasi, wamwimiliza. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Uchana ya pala jake wandika lupwilili lwa nhaguso yake lulonga, <char style="sc">“ino iyo yesu, mndewa wa wayahudi.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Wamuwamba Yesu mumsalaba hamoja na mibokonyi mibili, dimwe ng'ambu yake ya ukulume, na diyagwe ng'ambu yake ya ukumoso.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Wanhu wakalile wobita wamuliga, watigisa mapala gao <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>walonga, “Gweye iyo ulondile kuibomola Ng'anda ya Mulungu na kuizenga mmazua madatu, ikombole mwenyego! Ihawa gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu, humuluka kulawa mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Vivija na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na wavyele wa wanhu wamtendela uponela, walonga, <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“Kawakombola wayagwe, ila hadahile kuikombola mwenyego! Heyo iyo Mndewa wa Islaeli! Avo na yahumuluke kulawa mumsalaba, na tweye tomtogola! <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Komtamanila Mulungu, avo tulole vija Mulungu vondayamkombole, kwavija kalonga, ‘Nie iyo Mwana wa Mulungu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 27:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Vivija na ija imibokonyi iwambigwe hamoja na heyo imuliga.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kodanganhika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk. 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Songela kipigiti cha saa sita, kukala na ziza muisi yose mbaka kipigiti cha saa tisa. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Mkipigiti cha saa tisa, Yesu kenula dizwi kalila, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Nhegulo yake, “Mulungu wangu, Mulungu wangu, habali kundeka?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Wanhu wemile haja viwahulike, walonga, “Munhu ino komkema Eliya!” <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Bahaja munhu imwe kakimbila na kusola siponji, kaizabika muna idivai igwaduke na kuifunga kuisota ya lumango na kumng'weza Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 27:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Ila wayagwe walonga, “Muleke! Tulole kamba Eliya kokwiza kumkombola!”<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Yesu kenula dizwi kalila kabili, abaho, kadanganhika.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Kipigiti kikija, diguo ditungikwe Muing'anda ya Mulungu didegeka vidanga vibili, kulawa uchana mbaka hasi. Isi igudema, na mibwe itulika, <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>mapanga gatulika, na ng'huli za wanhu bwando wang'alile wadanganhike wazuka. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Yesu viyazukile, na hewo walawa hana gamapanga wachola hana diwambo ding'alile da Yelusalemu, na koneka na wanhu bwando.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Mkulu wa asikali mia wa Loma, hamoja na waja wakalile womwimiliza Yesu, viwawene mgudemo wa isi na gaja galawilile, wadumba na kulonga, “Kweli munhu ino kakala Mwana wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Hanhu haja kukala na watwanzi bwando wolola kutalitali, wakalile womkweleleza Yesu kulawa Galilaya na wakala womsang'hanikila. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Watwanzi hiwo wakala Maliamu wa kiwambo cha Magidala, Maliamu mamaake Yakobo na Usufu, na mama wa wanage Zebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uzisi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Viivikile ichungulo, keza mgoli imwe kulawa wambo da Alimataya, yakemigwe Usufu, vivija kakala mwanahina wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Kachola ha Pilato na kumpula lukuli lwa Yesu, na Pilato kalagiza kamba yagweleligwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Usufu kalusola ulukuli, kaluzinga sanda, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>na kulutambalika mdipanga jake mwenyego da sambi dipukigwe mdidibwe. Kadibimbilisa dibwe kulu na kudika hana umulomo wa idipanga, abaho, kachola. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Maliamu wa kiwambo cha Magidala na Maliamu iyagwe wakala hamgwazo wa idipanga.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wemilizi hana Dipanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Imitondo yake, ikala Zua da Mhumulo, wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na Mafalisayo wamcholela Pilato <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>na kulonga, “Mndewa, tokumbuka kamba viyakalile mgima, m'vwizi ija kalonga, ‘Gahabita mazua madatu nozuka.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Avo lagiza kamba panga jake diimilizwe mbaka zua da ikadatu, giladi wanahina zake sambiwachole kulusola ulukuli, na kuwalongela wanhu kamba kazuka. Uvwizi uno wa kimambukizo wokwiha ng'hani kubanza uja wa ichanduso.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilato kawalongela, “Soleni iwaasikali, gendeni mkadiimilize kamba vumdaha.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Avo wachola kudimiliza dipanga mkuweka asikali na kwika utango mumgwazo wa idibwe giladi kamba munhu yahadisegeza wavitange.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kozuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mlk. 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk. 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Vidimalile Zua da Mhumulo, imitondo iyagwe, zua vidikalile disimbuka, Maliamu wa ikiwambo cha Magidala na Maliamu iyagwe wachola kudilola dipanga. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Bahaja kulawilila na mgudemo mkulu wa isi, kwavija msenga wa Mndewa wa kuulanga kahumuluka kulawa kuulanga, kadibimbilisa idibwe kumgwazo, abaho, kadikalila. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Lukuli lwake lunang'hazika kamba lumwemwe, na vivalo vake vikala vizelu ng'hani. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Waja iwaasikali wadumba na kugudema ng'hani, walinga kamba wanhu wadanganhike.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Msenga wa Mndewa wa kuulanga kawalongela waja iwatwanzi, “Sambimdumbe, kwavija novitanga kamba momzahila Yesu, yawambigwe mumsalaba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Kahaduhu hano, kazuka, kamba viyalongile. Izoni mulole hanhu hayakalile yatambalale. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Tendeni mbwisa mchole mkawalongele wanahina zake kamba kazuka, kowalongola kuchola Galilaya ako kondammone. Uno uwo usenga wangu kumwenu.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Hima walawa hana dipanga, kuno wogudema na kudeng'ha ng'hani, abaho, wakimbila, wachola kuwalongela wanahina zake.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Bahaja Yesu kawating'hanila, kalonga, “Nowalamsa!” Wamcholela, wamgoga magulu gake na kumtambikila. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Sambimdumbe, gendeni mkawalongele wanahina zangu wachole Galilaya, ako wonyona.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usenga wa Iwaasikali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Waja iwatwanzi viwakalile mnzila, asikali wayagwe wakalile wodimiliza idipanga wachola mdiwambo kuwalongela wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko mbuli zose zilawilile. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko waiting'hana hamoja na wavyele wa wanhu, na viweshile kuitogolela, wawagwelela hela bwando iwaasikali, <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>wawalongela, “Longeni, ‘Vitukalile tuwasile, wanahina zake weza ikilo na kulwiba lukuli lwake.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Kamba mbuli ino iham'vikila mndewa wa Yudea kulawa Loma, tolonga nayo mkuwagombeleza giladi sambimgazigwe.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Avo iwaasikali wasola zihela na kutenda kamba viwalongeligwe. Na mbuli zino zibwililika mwa Wayahudi mbaka lelo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka lelo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti Matayo viyandike kitabu kino.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowalawilila Wanahina Zake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk. 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Sang'h. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Wanahina longo dimwe na imwe, wachola Galilaya hana ikigongo chayawalongele Yesu wachole. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Viwamuwene, wamtambikila, ila wanahina wayagwe wadungwadungwa mmoyo. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yesu kawakwenhukila kawalongela, “Nigweleligwa udaho wose kuulanga na muisi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Avo gendeni mkawatende wanhu wa isi zose wawe wanahina, na kuwabatiza mtwaga da Tata, na Mwana, na Loho wa Mulungu, <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>na kuwafundiza kugagoga gaja gose ganiwalongele mweye. Na nie na hamoja na mweye mazua gose, mbaka hakimambukizo cha iisi.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
